s","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":42870731,"login":"angelcolorado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODcwNzMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/4a2a67387a1ed4e420f5b6cfd46180a181897a1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T21:47:03Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T21:47:03Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"message":"feat(logistics): add corral edit and delete with overlap-safe update logic\n\n- Add secondsToTimeString() to time.utils.ts for ISO 8601 → HH:mm\n  form pre-population on edit; 7 new unit cases in time.utils.spec.ts\n- Add editingCorralId state to EventLogisticsComponent (null = create mode)\n- editCorral(): sets ID, converts each ISO 8601 field via isoToSeconds +\n  secondsToTimeString, resets form with pre-populated values, opens panel\n- deleteCorral(): filters corrals signal; calls closePanel() when the\n  deleted corral matches the one being edited to prevent stale sessions\n- onSubmit() edit branch: immutable map-with-spread preserving corralId,\n  order, and assignedPacers; overlap check excludes the editing corral\n  from otherCorrals to prevent self-conflict\n- openPanel() / closePanel() both clear editingCorralId\n- HTML: group/row + group-hover/row:opacity-100 reveals Edit (cyan) and\n  Delete (red) Heroicons buttons per corral row; panel title and submit\n  label reflect current mode dynamically\n- Add 21 new component spec cases: deleteCorral (3), editCorral (6),\n  onSubmit edit mode (5 including self-overlap guard and other-overlap)\n- Update README: slide-over panel section, time.utils table, ADRs,\n  testing table (58 util cases, 77 component cases)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df4374b4763b26ba994043468e7833b2a41be825","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/trees/df4374b4763b26ba994043468e7833b2a41be825"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/commits/4a2a67387a1ed4e420f5b6cfd46180a181897a1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42870731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":42870731,"login":"angelcolorado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODcwNzMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commit/4a2a67387a1ed4e420f5b6cfd46180a181897a1f","node_id":"C_kwDOS2yIYtoAKDRhMmE2NzM4N2ExZWQ0ZTQyMGY1YjZjZmQ0NjE4MGExODE4OTdhMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commit/9f304ebbfba76d889b5492d788fc285329143370","sha":"9f304ebbfba76d889b5492d788fc285329143370","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/9f304ebbfba76d889b5492d788fc285329143370"}],"sha":"4a2a67387a1ed4e420f5b6cfd46180a181897a1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/4a2a67387a1ed4e420f5b6cfd46180a181897a1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42870731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":42870731,"login":"angelcolorado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODcwNzMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/9f304ebbfba76d889b5492d788fc285329143370/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T21:30:40Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T21:30:40Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"message":"feat(logistics): extract time utils, add classification times, and cross-collection overlap validation\n\n- Create src/app/core/utils/time.utils.ts with five pure exported functions:\n  timeToSeconds, timeStringToIso8601, isoToSeconds, checkTimeOverlap, parseIsoDuration\n- Add 51 unit cases in time.utils.spec.ts covering all edge cases including\n  half-open interval boundary semantics for checkTimeOverlap\n- Add maleBaseTime / femaleBaseTime controls to corralForm; onSubmit maps\n  both to ISO 8601 with PT0S fallback\n- Tighten timeRangeValidator: minSec >= maxSec now invalid (zero-duration\n  corrals bypassed overlap detection; edge case: 01:05–01:05)\n- Integrate checkTimeOverlap in onSubmit with setErrors({ overlap: true })\n  and assertive aria-live error block in the HTML\n- DRY: remove duplicate timeToSeconds from LogisticsService; re-export\n  parseIsoDuration and timeStringToIso8601 for backward compatibility\n- CorralCardComponent imports parseIsoDuration directly from time.utils\n- Extend component spec to 46 cases + 10 timeRangeValidator standalone cases\n- Update README: Core Utilities section, form control table, overlap\n  validation docs, architectural decisions, testing table\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb765bd126eaadb8186673b8ed170fcda5d51d7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/trees/fb765bd126eaadb8186673b8ed170fcda5d51d7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/commits/9f304ebbfba76d889b5492d788fc285329143370","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42870731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_ur