tps://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/106c18fe0e99392ba0ec7f7a42e5a099c278b4fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T00:03:59Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T00:03:59Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"message":"feat(logistics): add slide-over corral form with cross-field validation and local state mutation\n\n- Add timeStringToIso8601() pure utility in LogisticsService: converts HH:mm / HH:mm:ss\n  to ISO 8601 duration (PT<n>S); returns null for empty, bad format, or out-of-range values\n- Add timeRangeValidator (exported ValidatorFn) at FormGroup level: fires only when both\n  minTime and maxTime have values; returns { timeRangeInvalid: true } when minSec > maxSec\n- Wire slide-over panel in EventLogisticsComponent: isSidePanelOpen signal, openPanel()\n  (reset + open), closePanel(), onSubmit() builds CorralDetail with crypto.randomUUID() and\n  mutates corrals signal via corrals.update(list => [...list, newCorral])\n- Display timeRangeInvalid error message with icon below time grid; both inputs turn\n  border-red-500 when the cross-field error is active\n- Fix stale mocks in auth, event-table, and event-list specs (token→accessToken,\n  date→raceDate, status values updated to match current EventStatus union)\n- Add 47 new spec cases: timeStringToIso8601 (9), timeRangeValidator standalone suite (9),\n  slide-over panel behavior (8), onSubmit signal mutation + ISO mapping (5)\n- Update README: slide-over panel section, timeStringToIso8601 utility table, onSubmit\n  architecture decisions, crypto.randomUUID and order assignment rationale\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 