durance-ui/commits/106c18fe0e99392ba0ec7f7a42e5a099c278b4fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42870731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":42870731,"login":"angelcolorado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODcwNzMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/473990e8ed3902814da066304142695a5d568740/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T22:16:44Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T22:16:44Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"message":"feat(logistics): add drag-and-drop corral builder with command-center card redesign\n\n- Install @angular/cdk@^21.2.14; import DragDropModule in EventLogisticsComponent\n- corrals: writable signal<CorralDetail[]> decoupled from immutable state signal —\n  onDrop() uses corrals.update() + moveItemInArray() on a spread copy to preserve\n  immutability; hasAnyCorrals is a computed() derived from corrals\n- cdkDropList + cdkDrag on each corral row; *cdkDragPreview (rotate-1 shadow-2xl);\n  *cdkDragPlaceholder (dashed blue gap); onDrop early-returns on same-index\n- Start Line anchor: static emerald bar with flag icon and 00:00:00 timestamp above list\n- CorralCardComponent redesigned as horizontal command-center row (h-16):\n  drag handle (cdkDragHandle, cursor-grab) | Col 1 identity | Col 2 time window\n  (font-mono) | Col 3 capacity (progress bar or ∞ Open)\n- accentClass replaces cardBorderClass: border-l-4 left accent (purple/amber/slate)\n- isOpenCapacity computed: maxCapacity=0 renders sky ∞ Open label + passive bar\n- occupancyPercent: registeredCount ?? 0 guards optional field — undefined/maxCapacity\n  produces NaN → Math.min(100, Math.round(NaN)) throws TypeError in all 4 template\n  expressions that consume occupancyPercent()\n- CorralDetail model updated to match real backend payload: name (replaces corralName),\n  maleBaseTime, femaleBaseTime, assignedPacers[], order/registeredCount optional\n- event-logistics.component.spec.ts: +2 cases (onDrop reorder, onDrop no-op same-index)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58b8865c05c4bf93d2be3288027ed1f814d3a898","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/trees/58b8865c05c4bf93d2be3288027ed1f814d3a898"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/commits/473990e8ed3902814da066304142695a5d568740","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42870731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":42870731,"login":"angelcolorado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODcwNzMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/orgs",