lsResponse, LogisticsEventSummary, Page<T>\n- @let s = state() in both templates to enable TypeScript union narrowing per Angular\n  template compiler constraints\n- app.routes.server.ts: RenderMode.Client for ** (was Prerender, caused NG04002 on all\n  dynamic routes); Prerender kept only for /login\n- Unit tests: logistics.service.spec.ts (13 cases), logistics-event-list.component.spec.ts\n  (9 cases), event-logistics.component.spec.ts (9 cases)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac8c0a59f8f0d7bf9d8822c82615c0f06ab1cf62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/trees/ac8c0a59f8f0d7bf9d8822c82615c0f06ab1cf62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/commits/dc7fb95a61ed427ae63a96b5fae899abd268b3e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42870731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":42870731,"login":"angelcolorado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODcwNzMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commit/dc7fb95a61ed427ae63a96b5fae899abd268b3e3","node_id":"C_kwDOS2yIYtoAKGRjN2ZiOTVhNjFlZDQyN2FlNjNhOTZiNWZhZTg5OWFiZDI2OGIzZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commit/04d5ec1a69bed46eb4f38e9189c96b90698c7c21","sha":"04d5ec1a69bed46eb4f38e9189c96b90698c7c21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/04d5ec1a69bed46eb4f38e9189c96b90698c7c21"}],"sha":"dc7fb95a61ed427ae63a96b5fae899abd268b3e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/dc7fb95a61ed427ae63a96b5fae899abd268b3e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42870731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":42870731,"login":"angelcolorado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODcwNzMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/04d5ec1a69bed46eb4f38e9189c96b90698c7c21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T22:32:58Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T22:32:58Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"message":"feat(events): connect event list to real API and add optimistic publish action\n\n- EventService.getEvents replaced mock with HttpClient.get to /api/v1/catalog/events;\n  handles both SpringPage<T> (server-side pagination) and plain T[] (client-side slice)\n- EventService.publishEvent added: PATCH /api/v1/catalog/events/{id}/status\n- EventModel updated: EventStatus narrowed to ''DRAFT'' | ''PUBLISHED'', raceDate replaces\n  date, registeredAthletes made optional (field absent from backend response)\n- EventTableComponent: publishEvent output<string>(), onPublish(), Actions column in\n  thead/tbody/skeleton (colspan 4→5), Publish ghost button visible only for DRAFT rows,\n  getStatusClasses updated for DRAFT (amber) / PUBLISHED (emerald)\n- EventListComponent: eventsPage changed from toSignal (readonly) to signal<EventsPage>\n  (writable) to enable optimistic update; onPublishEvent uses signal.update() to flip\n  status in-place — zero refetch, zero flicker\n- event-list.component.html: (publishEvent) output binding wired\n- README: Events feature section rewritten, Core Services table updated, new\n  architectural decisions documented\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c61b2170d5b0b3937c496c5c94e2d33de9222beb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/trees/c61b2170d5b0b3937c496c5c94e2d33de9222beb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/commits/04d5ec1a69bed46eb4f38e9189c96b90698c7c21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42870731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":428707