/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/9e2130c391531a124217e4fc38c4d4dddf0576b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T21:24:31Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T21:24:31Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"message":"feat(events): add CUSTOM distance support with conditional validators in EventCreateComponent\n\n- Add ''CUSTOM'' to DistanceCategory type and DISTANCE_CATEGORIES array\n- buildOffering() extends FormGroup with customDistanceName and distanceInMeters controls\n- distance.valueChanges subscription (takeUntilDestroyed) applies required/min(1) validators\n  conditionally; switching away from CUSTOM resets both fields and clears validators\n- DestroyRef injected once at component level and shared across all offering subscriptions\n- Template: @if block renders CUSTOM row (grid 2-col) only when distance === CUSTOM,\n  with aria-required, aria-invalid, aria-describedby, and scoped role=alert error messages\n- 5 new spec cases: optional baseline, required name, required meters, min(1) meters,\n  full reset on distance change (39 total test cases)\n- README updated: offerings table, form fields, UX decisions, architectural decisions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15c253859487f9229bf420e3093f612850d966a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/trees/15c253859487f9229bf420e3093f612850d966a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/commits/9e2130c391531a124217e4fc38c4d4dddf0576b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatar