html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":42870731,"login":"angelcolorado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODcwNzMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/624d532dae3c52b40d264b16ffb8b2be916dd30b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T21:56:21Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T21:56:21Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"message":"feat(events): add EventCreateComponent with multipart form and enum offerings\n\n- EventCreateComponent with ReactiveFormsModule, futureDateValidator, and dynamic\n  FormArray for offerings (DistanceCategory enum selects) and a static tier row\n- EventService.createCatalogEntry sends multipart/form-data; documentVersion ''1.0''\n  injected immutably via spread before JSON.stringify — Content-Type never set manually\n- File upload trigger uses template-ref + display:none input to prevent sr-only scroll-jump\n- Global scroll fix: html/body/app-root height:100% overflow:hidden in styles.css;\n  shell changed from h-screen to h-full to prevent double-scroll on long forms\n- Lazy route /events/new registered under authGuard shell in app.routes.ts\n- 28 unit tests in event-create.component.spec.ts covering validators, FormArray\n  mutations, file selection, HTTP happy/error paths, isLoading lifecycle, and DOM state\n- README updated: route map, feature section, architectural decisions, testing table\n\nCo-Author