:"feat(dashboard): implement logistics command center with Signals and Tailwind grid\n\n- Build DashboardComponent as a full operations overview: 4-column metrics\n  grid (registered athletes, active waves, corral capacity, assigned pacers)\n  and an upcoming events table with color-coded logistics status badges\n- Drive all state via typed Angular Signals (SummaryMetric[], UpcomingEvent[])\n  so swapping in real API data requires no template changes\n- Export SummaryMetric, UpcomingEvent, LogisticsStatus interfaces for future\n  service integration\n- Remove Angular scaffold boilerplate from app.html (344 lines → router-outlet)\n- Add dashboard.component.spec.ts: 16 tests covering metric rendering, trend\n  colors, badge classes, signal reactivity, and a11y aria-labels\n- Update README with dashboard section, badge color table, and new arch decisions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"791cfe64ace4785e9242c1d6ed61f8f233b43875","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/trees/791cfe64ace4785e9242c1d6ed61f8f233b43875"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/commits/715dbca7cc9f5a6ffed93a5800006681c836871d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42870731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":42870731,"login":"angelcolorado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODcwNzMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/received_events","repos_