b.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/823e06024ac57fc54d48f828e96f861c65975c36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T20:28:17Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T20:28:17Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"message":"feat(shell): add MainLayoutComponent, nested auth routing, and login error handling\n\n- Introduce MainLayoutComponent (sidebar, topbar, router-outlet) as the\n  protected application shell; authGuard moved to layout level so all\n  child routes inherit protection automatically\n- Refactor app.routes.ts to nest /dashboard under the layout shell\n- Fix tsconfig.spec.json rootDir to resolve TS6059 compiler warning\n- Upgrade login error handling: status-aware resolveErrorMessage() replaces\n  the generic hasError signal; removes BadCredentials workaround after\n  backend contract fix (BadCredentialsException now returns HTTP 401)\n- Translate all login UI strings to English (labels, validation, button copy)\n- Add login.component.spec.ts and main-layout.component.spec.ts with full\n  unit coverage for all new and modified behaviour\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8db0c519e89ff0cb76eaf876a644a7362a8b3f96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/trees/8db0c519e89ff0cb76eaf876a644a7362a8b3f96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/commits/823e06024ac57fc54d48f828e96f861c65975c36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42870731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":42870731,"login":"angelcolorado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODcwNzMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commit/823e06024ac57fc54d48f828e96f861c65975c36","node_id":"C_kwDOS2yIYtoAKDgyM2UwNjAyNGFjNTdmYzU0ZDQ4ZjgyOGU5NmY4NjFjNjU5NzVjMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commit/bb7402dabffe0c38ff2c529ce78107ec1c776479","sha":"bb7402dabffe0c38ff2c529ce78107ec1c776479","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/bb7402dabffe0c38ff2c529ce78107ec1c776479"}],"sha":"823e06024ac57fc54d48f828e96f861c65975c36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/823e06024ac57fc54d48f828e96f861c65975c36"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42870731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":42870731,"login":"angelcolorado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODcwNzMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/bb7402dabffe0c38ff2c529ce78107ec1c776479/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T23:27:16Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T23:27:16Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"message":"feat(auth): add AuthGuard, JWT interceptor, and SSR-safe token rehydration\n\n- authGuard (CanActivateFn): blocks unauthenticated access to /dashboard; returns true on SSR to prevent premature redirect before browser hydration\n- jwtInterceptor (HttpInterceptorFn): injects Authorization Bearer header on every request; calls authService.logout() on 401\n- Register jwtInterceptor via withInterceptors in app.config.ts\n- Protect /dashboard route with canActivate: [authGuard] in app.routes.ts\n- AuthService: expose isAuthenticated getter over raw BehaviorSubject getValue()\n- auth.guard.spec.ts: 3 tests covering browser (authenticated, unauthenticated) and server (SSR passthrough) platforms\n- jwt.interceptor.spec.ts: 4 tests covering header injection, no-token case, 401 logout trigger, non-401 passthrough\n- README: document security infra, updated route map with guard column, expanded test coverage section\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"067af0eea44727e9dc3633c6db74342380dcbb34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/trees/067af0eea44727e9dc3633c6db74342380dcbb34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/git/commits/bb7402dabffe0c38ff2c529ce78107ec1c776479","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,