"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelcolorado","id":42870731,"login":"angelcolorado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODcwNzMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelcolorado","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angelcolorado/endurance-ui/commits/ac3c35d22b0e629b277d3714d2c2890166fa4967/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T22:45:39Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T22:45:39Z","email":"angelcolorado@outlook.com","name":"Angel Colorado"},"message":"feat(auth): persist token, add unit tests, and harden a11y on login\n\n- AuthService: rehydrate isLoggedIn$ from localStorage on init (SSR-safe via isPlatformBrowser)\n- AuthService: persist token on login(), clear on logout() with redirect to /login\n- AuthService: centralize logout navigation — single call point for future guards/interceptors\n- auth.service.spec.ts: 4 Vitest tests covering init state, rehydration, login POST + localStorage, logout\n- login.component.html: aria-required, aria-invalid, aria-describedby on all inputs\n- login.component.html: role=alert + aria-live=assertive on error regions, aria-hidden on decorative SVGs\n- login.component.html: h2 → h1 for correct document outline\n- README: document testing setup, a11y compliance, and new architectural decisions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc62046010d5bb16121cadbbe9e987b30eca892a","url":"https://api.github.com/