tannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/7eb95e6e401c5bb6256d4d95a631dcabe04e90e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:12:30Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:12:30Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"Migrates the cluster layout to the host''s array parameter spec\n\n`parameters` is now an ordered `LayoutParameter[]` (the shared spec from\ncytoscape-web #734), keyed by displayName and nested by `groups`:\n\n- \"Cluster Column\" is a `nodeColumn` picker offering every column type but\n  double and the list types (`columnTypeFilter: [''string'', ''long'',\n  ''integer'', ''boolean'']`), \"(none)\" when unset\n- the spacing parameters are `text` + `digits` with minValue/maxValue in\n  place of `range`; \"Satellites\" is a `checkBox`\n- \"Run MCODE if the network has no result\" is removed: with no column and\n  no MCODE result the layout always runs MCODE first, and the Cluster Column\n  tooltip says so\n- `run` reads its values by label (`parameters[''Node Spacing'']`), already\n  typed by the host\n\nRequires @cytoscape-web/api-types 1.0.0-beta.5 (array spec, list-valued\ncolumnTypeFilter).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e334014d1fbccd56d1fd106ecf4218088676674c","url":"