html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/e4549f18f0a0a99b16fbe2b3812845825eed5b40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:11:39Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:11:39Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"feat: package the app for the Cytoscape App Store\n\n`npm run build:zip` now writes mcode-<version>.zip with the generated\ncy-manifest.json, via @cytoscape-web/app-runtime 0.4.0-next.1 (the first\nversion that emits the submission manifest). Store metadata — author,\nlicense, repository, homepage, keywords — fills the manifest from\npackage.json.\n\nNode 24 is enforced rather than suggested: .nvmrc for nvm, engine-strict\nso npm install refuses an older Node, and a guard in vite.config.ts —\nengines alone let a build run on older Node.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4cbab904d7aba8f8161e5f8b395b3e5a74363036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/git/trees/4cbab904d7aba8f8161e5f8b395b3e5a74363036"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/git/commits/e4549f18f0a0a99b16fbe2b3812845825eed5b40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commit/e4549f18f0a0a99b16fbe2b3812845825eed5b40","node_id":"C_kwDOS2zfjdoAKGU0NTQ5ZjE4ZjBhMGE5OWIxNmZiZTJiMzgxMjg0NTgyNWVlZDViNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commit/3f515d023a87cbd27b56a2897fd9e314228092f7","sha":"3f515d023a87cbd27b56a2897fd9e314228092f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/3f515d023a87cbd27b56a2897fd9e314228092f7"}],"sha":"e4549f18f0a0a99b16fbe2b3812845825eed5b40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/e4549f18f0a0a99b16fbe2b3812845825eed5b40"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2328291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d2fong","id":2328291,"login":"d2fong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjgyOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/74465df8aedceaed0843835e023ffaf2d0756789/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:10:28Z","email":"dylanfong.ut@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Fong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:10:28Z","email":"dylanfong.ut@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Fong"},"message":"Removes the tracing added while diagnosing the frozen-object crash.\n\nEvery storage step logged a line and window.__mcodeAppData() dumped the\nstate; both existed to find the `Cannot assign to read only property\n''nodePositions''` failure, which is fixed. What stays is failure reporting\nonly: a warning per failed read or write (naming the API error code), a\nwarning when the host has no appData domain at all, and the panel''s\nconsole.error if restoring throws.\n\nAlso drops describeStoredResults, which reported WHICH validation check a\nstored payload failed. It duplicated the validators next to it, and the\nplain \"unreadable and have been dropped\" warning is enough.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f004340fe7ef726e300edcc693e5237169adc723","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/git/trees/f004340fe7ef726e300edcc693e5237169adc723"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/git/commits/74465df8aedceaed0843835e023ffaf2d0756789","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2328291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d2fong","id":2328291,"login":"d2fong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjgyOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commit/74465df8aedceaed0843835e023ffaf2d0756789","node_id":"C_kwDOS2zfjdoAKDc0NDY1ZGY4YWVkY2VhZWQwODQzODM1ZTAyM2ZmYWYyZDA3NTY3ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commit/7cc2edc4a7413bc357c50dbc8a00ca4ef27c3869","sha":"7cc2edc4a7413bc357c50dbc8a00ca4ef27c3869","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/7cc2edc4a7413bc357c50dbc8a00ca4ef27c3869"}],"sha":"74465df8aedceaed0843835e023ffaf2d0756789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/74465df8aedceaed0843835e023ffaf2d0756789"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2328291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d2fong","id":2328291,"login":"d2fong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjgyOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/7cc2edc4a7413bc357c50dbc8a00ca4ef27c3869/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:07:22Z","email":"dylanfong.ut@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Fong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:07:22Z","email":"dylanfong.ut@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Fong"},"message":"Stores MCODE results per network through the App API''s appData domain.\n\nResults lived only in mcodeResultStore, module state that dies with the page.\nSwitching network left the previous network''s clusters on screen, and a reload\nlost every result while its MCODE node columns stayed on the network.\n\nResults are now written to the host''s per-app storage, one entry per network,\nand read back per network. Two behaviors follow: the panel follows the current\nnetwork, and results survive a reload (and an app disable/enable — appData is\nthe one per-app domain the host does not clean up).\n\nNew:\n  mcodeResultPersistence.ts  the JSON form of a result. The algorithm''s worker\n                             snapshot holds Maps, which structured clone takes\n                             and JSON does not, so they become entry arrays.\n                             Cluster thumbnails are dropped (regenerated on\n                             demand; one entry is capped at 5 MB). Everything\n                             read back is validated, and the payload is deep\n                             copied — appData.get() returns the host''s frozen\n                             object, and the panel writes to what it reads.\n  mcodeAppData.ts            holds the api from mount(), writes on every store\n                             change (debounced 400 ms, skipped when the bytes\n                             are unchanged), reads once per network. The\n                             result-id counter goes through setGlobal, since\n                             result ids name node columns and a reloaded\n                             session must not reissue one.\n\nChanged:\n  mcodeResultStore  restoreNetworkResults, syncSelectionToNetwork, the counter\n                    accessors, and a subscribe hook for the writer.\n  MCODEPanel        hydrates and re-points the selection on mount and on every\n                    network:switched; no longer caches a FAILED getEdges read,\n                    which would have left every thumbnail blank after a reload.\n\nNeeds a host with the appData API (cytoscape/cytoscape-web#687). README has\nthe npm link step for the types until they are published.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"514e428a6f546cb9ea9eca6877d9e30683459a94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/git/trees/514e428a6f546cb9ea9eca6877d9e30683459a94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/git/commits/7cc2edc4a7413bc357c50dbc8a00ca4ef27c3869","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2328291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d2fong","id":2328291,"login":"d2fong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjgyOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commit/7cc2edc4a7413bc357c50dbc8a00ca4ef27c3869","node_id":"C_kwDOS2zfjdoAKDdjYzJlZGM0YTc0MTNiYzM1N2M1MGRiYzhhMDBjYTRlZjI3YzM4Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commit/3f515d023a87cbd27b56a2897fd9e314228092f7","sha":"3f515d023a87cbd27b56a2897fd9e314228092f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/3f515d023a87cbd27b56a2897fd9e314228092f7"}],"sha":"7cc2edc4a7413bc357c50dbc8a00ca4ef27c3869","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/7cc2edc4a7413bc357c50dbc8a00ca4ef27c3869"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/3f515d023a87cbd27b56a2897fd9e314228092f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T15:41:40Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T15:41:40Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"New Analysis dialog closes on ESCAPE key down.","tree":{"sha":"96a0f2708c655d153835e96c8b869b2fcb7faf61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/git/trees/96a0f2708c655d153835e96c8b869b2fcb7faf61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/git/commits/3f515d023a87cbd27b56a2897fd9e314228092f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commit/3f515d023a87cbd27b56a2897fd9e314228092f7","node_id":"C_kwDOS2zfjdoAKDNmNTE1ZDAyM2E4N2NiZDI3YjU2YTI4OTdmZDllMzE0MjI4MDkyZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commit/8bc049f190827fb21b17d2f24f2ab6a48908868f","sha":"8bc049f190827fb21b17d2f24f2ab6a48908868f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/8bc049f190827fb21b17d2f24f2ab6a48908868f"}],"sha":"3f515d023a87cbd27b56a2897fd9e314228092f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/3f515d023a87cbd27b56a2897fd9e314228092f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commits/8bc049f190827fb21b17d2f24f2ab6a48908868f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T17:18:21Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T17:18:21Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"Moves MCODE results to a module-level store so they survive Side Panel close.\n\nClosing Cytoscape Web''s Side Panel unmounts the whole panel tree, wiping\nany component state — so results kept in MCODEPanel''s useState vanished on\nclose. Following NetworkAnalyzer''s analysisResultStore pattern, results,\nselection, the monotonic result id, and the network-edge cache now live in\nsrc/model/mcodeResultStore.ts (module scope + useSyncExternalStore), and\nthe panel re-reads them on remount. The edge cache entry for a network is\nnow also dropped when that network is deleted.\n\nAlso fixes `npm test` silently running stale compiled tests: the base\ntsconfig''s exclude of *.test.ts was inherited by tsconfig.test.json,\ncancelling its include, so tsc compiled nothing and node --test ran old\ndist-test/ output. Overrides the exclude, adds store unit tests, and\nuntracks dist-test/ (build output, now gitignored).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"423d8f1ba58c1481bf1a848750143ca8584818f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/git/trees/423d8f1ba58c1481bf1a848750143ca8584818f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/mcode-cw/git/commits/8bc049f190827fb21b17d2f24f2ab6a48908868f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/mcode-cw/commit/8bc049f190827fb21b17d2f24f2ab6a48908868f","node_id":"C_kwDOS2zfjdoAKDhiYzA0OWYxOTA4MjdmYjIxYjE3ZDJmMjRmMmFiNmE0ODkwODg2OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/