izations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpdesi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpdesi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpdesi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpdesi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpdesi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpdesi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dpdesi/serverless-architecture-patterns/commits/5ddac5b8f09551ee2a35d9744f0387c564d8a4f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T17:23:56Z","email":"duvane@deslandes.co.uk","name":"dpdesi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T17:23:56Z","email":"duvane@deslandes.co.uk","name":"dpdesi"},"message":"Embed the draw.io tab images in the pattern docs\n\nEach pattern page referenced its diagram tab by name only. Export one\nPNG per tab from patterns-clean.drawio and embed it in the matching\npage (both modes for the control service), add the primitives tab to\nthe primitives page, the glyph-alphabet legend to the pattern-reference\nindex, and the online-order worked example to the composition guide.\nEvery image carries descriptive alt text and still links to the\neditable .drawio source.\n\nAlso commit the BFF tab''s description-panel height tweak in\npatterns-clean.drawio, so the committed source matches the exported\nbff-service.png.\n\nAll markdown links, anchors, and the 15 embedded images verified to\nresolve.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e785b52cd7c3579d00721a1b09a7a19f0381cc25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dpdesi/serverless-architecture-patterns/git/trees/e785b52cd7c3579d00721a1b09a7a19f0381cc25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dpdesi/serverless-architecture-patterns/git/commits/5ddac5b8f09551ee2a35d9744f0387c564d8a4f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verif