mprove orchestrator error handling and container resolution\n\nKey changes:\n- Replace direct file writes in _write_orchestrator_log with delegation\n  to orchestrator.pipeline logger via LEVEL_MAP\n- Add _resolve_orchestrator_container_id helper with three-level\n  resolution: (1) socket.gethostname(), (2) Config.Hostname match,\n  (3) network membership heuristic — handles non-standard hostnames\n  and dev environments\n- Make _ensure_agent_network idempotent-safe by checking network attrs\n  for existing connection before calling connect()\n- Replace logger calls with sys_logger (orchestrator logger) for\n  system-level events and _write_orchestrator_log for pipeline-level\n  events\n- Add pipeline-scoped log entries for error conditions that were\n  previously only written to django.log\n- Update clang-format glob to include .c, .cpp, .h, .hpp extensions\n- Remove trailing blank lines","tree":{"sha":"605dc0498bb31ff288a9250814df7d0923aa2b21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WywySenarios/Wywy-Codes/git/trees/605dc0498bb31ff288a9250814df7d0923aa2b21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WywySenarios/Wywy-Codes/git/commits/23fc604f3f1ec81195ac359032aa242cd04a1299","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77202595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WywySenarios","id":77202595,"login":"WywySenarios","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MjAyNTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WywySenarios/Wywy-Codes/commit/23fc604f3f1ec81195ac359032aa242cd04a1299","node_id":"C_kwDOS3G5NNoAKDIzZmM2MDRmM2YxZWM4MTE5NWFjMzU5MDMyYWEyNDJjZDA0YTEyOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WywySenarios/Wywy-Codes/commit/249f3efca68aed78a3cb849e25d57a7279cc43b2","sha":"249f3efca68aed78a3cb849e25d57a7279cc43b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WywySenarios/Wywy-Codes/commits/249f3efca68aed78a3cb849e25d57a7279cc43b2"}],"sha":"23fc604f3f1ec81195ac359032aa242cd04a1299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WywySenarios/Wywy-Codes/commits/23fc604f3f1ec81195ac359032aa242cd04a1299"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77202595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WywySenarios","id":77202595,"login":"WywySenarios","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MjAyNTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WywySenarios/Wywy-Codes/commits/249f3efca68aed78a3cb849e25d57a7279cc43b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T23:40:07Z","email":"wywyericzhu@gmail.com","name":"Eric Zhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T23:40:07Z","email":"wywyericzhu@gmail.com","name":"Eric Zhu"},"message":"feat(django): add consolidated SPA and system log API endpoints\n\nNew endpoints for consolidated log access:\n- GET /api/pipelines/<id>/logs/all/ — returns entries from ALL log files\n  for a pipeline merged and sorted by timestamp (including system log)\n- GET /api/logs/system/ — returns entries from the shared system-level\n  orchestrator.log\n- GET /api/logs/django/ — returns entries from django.log (Django app\n  errors, tracebacks)\n- GET /api/logs/spa/ — consolidated endpoint for the SPA frontend;\n  always returns system + django entries, plus per-pipeline files when\n  ?pipeline_id= is provided\n\nRefactored shared helpers (_read_log_file_entries, _pipeline_log_files,\n_ts_key, _single_file_log_view) to reduce duplication across endpoints.\n\nUpdated tests:\n- Moved create_log_file / create_pipeline_log helpers to module-level\n  for reuse across all test classes\n- Added TestLogsAll, TestSystemLogs, TestDjangoLogs, TestLogsSpa test\n  classes covering the new endpoints","tree":{"sha":"55168febc7ecdb065840f25a5756765b6be4cb1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WywySenarios/Wywy-Codes/git/trees/55168febc7ecdb065840f25a5756765b6be4cb1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WywySenarios/Wywy-Codes/git/commits/249f3efca68aed78a3cb849e25d57a7279cc43b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77202595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenario