ists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WywySenarios","id":77202595,"login":"WywySenarios","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MjAyNTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WywySenarios","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WywySenarios/Wywy-Codes/commits/a0687663a4a9b4c8cfd54e6d2ecaeabb3cb8c7e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T02:20:45Z","email":"wywyericzhu@gmail.com","name":"Eric Zhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T02:20:45Z","email":"wywyericzhu@gmail.com","name":"Eric Zhu"},"message":"fix: skip secrets/ directory during workspace copy to avoid PermissionError\n\nThe control repo at /etc/Wywy-Website-Control contains a secrets/\nsubdirectory with mode 700 and GID 2523 no-access. shutil.copytree\nfailed with PermissionError when trying to descend into it, aborting\nthe entire workspace creation.\n\nReplace bare shutil.copytree with _copy_source_tree that passes an\nignore callback filtering out the name ''secrets'' from each directory\nlisting. The callback is called BEFORE descent, so copytree never\nattempts to scandir the locked directory.\n\nTest: creates a source tree with an inaccessible subdirectory (chmod\n000), runs _create_workspace, asserts copy completes with at least\none entry.","tree":{"sha":"ef1b1f481eaf55d6081aac068f6c9b7fa549229b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WywySenarios/Wywy-Codes/git/trees/ef1b1f481eaf55d6081aac068f6c9b7fa549229b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WywySenarios/Wywy-Codes/git/commits/a0687663a4a9b4c8cfd54e6d2ecaeabb3cb8c7e3","verification"