igned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Kusumareddy28/vigil-hackathon/commit/6b550324cd94a8d92e9885eb1f5c202d4f62df53","node_id":"C_kwDOS3MkytoAKDZiNTUwMzI0Y2Q5NGE4ZDkyZTk4ODVlYjFmNWMyMDJkNGY2MmRmNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kusumareddy28/vigil-hackathon/commit/d1a4d08aa7a50bf78f4016f06a742e2d82066981","sha":"d1a4d08aa7a50bf78f4016f06a742e2d82066981","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kusumareddy28/vigil-hackathon/commits/d1a4d08aa7a50bf78f4016f06a742e2d82066981"}],"sha":"6b550324cd94a8d92e9885eb1f5c202d4f62df53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kusumareddy28/vigil-hackathon/commits/6b550324cd94a8d92e9885eb1f5c202d4f62df53"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kusumareddy28/vigil-hackathon/commits/d1a4d08aa7a50bf78f4016f06a742e2d82066981/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:17:16Z","email":"yashwanth.s@sap.com","name":"I528710"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:17:16Z","email":"yashwanth.s@sap.com","name":"I528710"},"message":"feat: wire Agent Activity to live SSE + real stats\n\n- Add useSSE hook that connects to /api/events and maps trace/sla_update/incident events to AgentFeedEvent[]\n- Replace mock-data drip in AgentActivityFeed with real SSE stream\n- Add GET /api/agent-stats endpoint (actions24h, reasoning cycles, auto-recoveries, median response)\n- Wire AgentActivityPage to live stats via react-query\n- Fix Layer 1 readiness heuristic in decisions endpoint (use health data when no trace exists)","tree":{"sha":"b26a5f27b2b60e56c7e95585b91df6c4d2661734","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kusumareddy28/vigil-hackathon/git/trees/b26a5f27b2b60e56c7e95585b91df6c4d2661734"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kusumareddy28/vigil-hackathon/git/commits/d1a4d08aa7a50bf78f4016f06a742e2d82066981","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"h