gr0310","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohitagr0310/datalakehouse-pipeline-aws/commits/049f99190757e272155954bbf47a527820460527/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T09:55:55Z","email":"rohitagr2610@gmail.com","name":"rohitagr0310"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T09:55:55Z","email":"rohitagr2610@gmail.com","name":"rohitagr0310"},"message":"feat: Add Terraform modules for IAM, Monitoring, Networking, RDS, S3, and Step Functions\n\n- Implemented IAM outputs and variables for Glue and Step Functions roles.\n- Created Monitoring module with SNS alerts, CloudWatch event rules, and dashboards.\n- Developed Networking module for VPC, subnets, and security groups.\n- Added RDS module for PostgreSQL instance with enhanced monitoring and Secrets Manager integration.\n- Established S3 module for raw, processed, and Glue scripts buckets with lifecycle policies.\n- Introduced Step Functions module for pipeline orchestration with logging configuration.\n- Updated root Terraform configuration with new outputs and provider settings.\n- Added example `terraform.tfvars` for easy configuration.","tree":{"sha":"8e6a2b506bedc352260e0c265633a6c41c375832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohitagr0310/datalakehouse-pipeline-aws/git/trees/8e6a2b506bedc352260e0c265633a6c41c375832"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohitagr0310/datalakehouse-pipeline-aws/git/commits/049f99190757e272155954bbf47a527820460527","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110839621?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitagr0310/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitagr0310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitagr0310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitagr0310/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt