ser","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/commits/91488acbfeb1fbb835ef9bff8d095b181012e29f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T15:39:07Z","email":"jeffaporta@gmail.com","name":"Jeff-Aporta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T15:39:07Z","email":"jeffaporta@gmail.com","name":"Jeff-Aporta"},"message":"fix(boot-resolver): URL relativa se intenta antes que jsDelivr incluso fuera de dev\n\nHasta ahora la URL relativa al import.meta.url solo se añadía a la lista de candidatos cuando el host era localhost; en producción jsDelivr era la primera opción y rompía GitHub Pages cuando el host se servía desde subpath. Se reorganizó el orden para intentar primero la copia vendorizada junto al boot-loader, conservando el mismo contrato en dev. La consecuencia directa es que front-shared ahora resuelve de manera estable tanto en Pages como en servidores estáticos servidos desde cualquier dominio, sin reintroducir la dependencia de jsDelivr en despliegues locales.","tree":{"sha":"9e487069604ea09c2f53d309f7adb93d83124576","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/git/trees/9e487069604ea09c2f53d309f7adb93d83124576"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/git/commits/91488acbfeb1fbb835ef9bff8d095b181012e29f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73729410?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jeff-Aporta","id":73729410,"login":"Jeff-Aporta","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNzI5NDEw","or