"message":"chore: Se publica el pin 37aa772 tras el layout de panel lateral compartido\n\nSe actualizaron las referencias internas del paquete compartido al commit publicado que incorpora el layout de panel lateral redimensionable, de modo que demos, plantillas y constantes de arranque apunten al mismo artefacto en jsDelivr. Con ello las aplicaciones consumidoras pueden fijar un pin coherente sin depender de copias locales del monorepo. El ajuste cierra el ciclo de publicación del componente antes de integrarlo en pantallas de trabajo.","tree":{"sha":"d4050a37ba187f1934906e245d2310bedde948a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/git/trees/d4050a37ba187f1934906e245d2310bedde948a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/git/commits/7c003901622500b62e7634ad9aef4f5b31832da6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73729410?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jeff-Aporta","id":73729410,"login":"Jeff-Aporta","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNzI5NDEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/commit/7c003901622500b62e7634ad9aef4f5b31832da6","node_id":"C_kwDOS3SBmdoAKDdjMDAzOTAxNjIyNTAwYjYyZTc2MzRhZDlhZWY0ZjViMzE4MzJkYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/commit/37aa772d768996afcf1b6ea64099335e85330411","sha":"37aa772d768996afcf1b6ea64099335e85330411","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/commits/37aa772d768996afcf1b6ea64099335e85330411"}],"sha":"7c003901622500b62e7634ad9aef4f5b31832da6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/commits/7c003901622500b62e7634ad9aef4f5b31832da6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73729410?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jeff-Aporta","id":73729410,"login":"Jeff-Aporta","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNzI5NDEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/commits/37aa772d768996afcf1b6ea64099335e85330411/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T17:07:54Z","email":"jeffaporta@gmail.com","name":"Jeff-Aporta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T17:07:54Z","email":"jeffaporta@gmail.com","name":"Jeff-Aporta"},"message":"feat: Panel lateral redimensionable y colapsable para vistas de trabajo\n\nSe incorporó un layout reutilizable con panel izquierdo ajustable en ancho, colapso al icono al pulsar el título y área principal a la derecha, con estilo neon-glass por defecto y soporte para otros temas visuales. Las pantallas que alternan listado y detalle ganan continuidad al conservar el ancho preferido del usuario y más espacio útil al revisar contenido extenso. En conjunto, el cambio unifica la experiencia entre herramientas y facilita comparar y afinar el comportamiento antes de extenderlo al resto de aplicaciones.","tree":{"sha":"32c2ef6deee47a182db1d03bdac062dc28ef6f81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/git/trees/32c2ef6deee47a182db1d03bdac062dc28ef6f81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/git/commits/37aa772d768996afcf1b6ea64099335e85330411","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73729410?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jeff-Aporta","id":73729410,"login":"Jeff-Aporta","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNzI5NDEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Aporta","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jeff-Aporta/front-shared/commit/37aa772d768996afcf1b6ea64099335e85330411","node_id":"C_kwDOS3SBmdoAKDM3YWE3Nz