ubscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/commits/6129e7051283c5407370eee3f9b2b40320068a9a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:25:39Z","email":"cdwilhite0601@gmail.com","name":"Craig D Wilhite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:25:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(portal): scope resource URLs to organizations and workspaces (#703)\n\n* feat(portal): scope resource URLs to organizations and workspaces\n\n* fix(portal): reset account caches and recover failed navigation\n\n* test(kuery): expect scoped impact navigation links","tree":{"sha":"5c793861c35c7e006b9d0f6dd2dcac615f3dc83c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/git/trees/5c793861c35c7e006b9d0f6dd2dcac615f3dc83c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/git/commits/6129e7051283c5407370eee3f9b2b40320068a9a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/commit/6129e7051283c5407370eee3f9b2b40320068a9a","node_id":"C_kwDOS3qZj9oAKDYxMjllNzA1MTI4M2M1NDA3MzcwZWVlM2Y5YjJiNDAzMjAwNjhhOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/commit/514325433802cc4c12b40c9cfce8acea4ee1ff85","sha":"514325433802cc4c12b40c9cfce8acea4ee1ff85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/commits/514325433802cc4c12b40c9cfce8acea4ee1ff85"}],"sha":"6129e7051283c5407370eee3f9b2b40320068a9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/commits/6129e7051283c5407370eee3f9b2b40320068a9a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/commits/514325433802cc4c12b40c9cfce8acea4ee1ff85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T08:26:01Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T08:26:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"cli: regroup the command tree, add connect/org/workspace members/whoami; tenant cluster-ID headers and provider fixes (#704)\n\nCLI (pkg/cli, test/e2e/suites/cli, docs/cli):\n- Group `faros --help` by intent; make --insecure-skip-tls-verify global;\n  hide legacy spellings (list/ls, kubeconfig edge, get, apply, get-token)\n  and move kcp workspace navigation to hidden `kcp-workspace`.\n- New: whoami, logout, token [--refresh], connect/disconnect (merged\n  faros-<edge> context), edge kubeconfig [-o|--merge], org list|create,\n  workspace list|create, and members list|add|remove|set-role at org and\n  workspace scope over the existing hub REST API.\n- Shared -o wide|json|yaml|name output, --yes confirmations, shell\n  completion for edge names, roles and formats.\n- Fix edge type detection (spec.type no longer exists), hub commands\n  following an edge context after connect, un-externalized proxy URLs,\n  and the error when the edges provider is not enabled.\n- Generated CLI reference (faros docs, make docs-cli, verify-docs-cli in\n  make verify); e2e suite test/e2e/suites/cli (make e2e-cli + CI job) with\n  a two-user hub, the edges provider, an in-process sshd and kind.\n- Refresh-token flow covered by tests against a fake OIDC issuer.\n- Fix install.sh archive names and next steps; dex examples now register\n  faros as a PKCE public client (public: true).\n\nHub and providers:\n- The hub proxy and MCP federation send the kcp cluster ID in\n  X-Faros-Tenant / X-Faros-Cluster and never the workspace path;\n  providers resolve org/workspace via provider-sdk/tenantaccess.\n  BREAKING for providers that parse a path from X-Faros-Tenant: roll\n  providers out before the hub.\n- Delegated provider tokens may read org/workspace rosters and invite to\n  an org (App Studio grants).\n- provider-sdk/apiexportprovider: apiexport multicluster provider that\n  retries failed endpoint watches, with a readiness check; adopted by the\n  hub and providers.\n- Edges: Workload spec.targetNamespace and simple.imagePullSecrets,\n  pod-template metadata preserved, cross-namespace pruning, agent\n  hostname reporting, stdin for ssh exec, backoff for service probes.\n- Kuery: key engaged clusters by cluster ID with an orphan sweep;\n  kuery_query MCP tool takes spec as an object.\n- Agents, App Studio, code: status stamping, GET-by-name routes,\n  publishing mode reporting, invite and preview fixes, build.yaml default.","tree":{"sha":"ad904a69e2464970f66d0d3c83dc9f9858871163","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/git/trees/ad904a69e2464970f66d0d3c83dc9f9858871163"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/git/commits/514325433802cc4c12b40c9cfce8acea4ee1ff85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/commit/514325433802cc4c12b40c9cfce8acea4ee1ff85","node_id":"C_kwDOS3qZj9oAKDUxNDMyNTQzMzgwMmNjNGMxMmI0MGM5Y2ZjZThhY2VhNGVlMWZmODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/commit/4b59d1643735c2982a0bcc7ddc6088d7679d4204","sha":"4b59d1643735c2982a0bcc7ddc6088d7679d4204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/commits/4b59d1643735c2982a0bcc7ddc6088d7679d4204"}],"sha":"514325433802cc4c12b40c9cfce8acea4ee1ff85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/commits/514325433802cc4c12b40c9cfce8acea4ee1ff85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/commits/4b59d1643735c2982a0bcc7ddc6088d7679d4204/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:42:04Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:42:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[AUTOMATED BOT PR] Serve org-owned provider UI bundles over the edge with hub-issued grants; fix infrastructure operator heartbeat credential (#696)\n\n* Serve org-owned provider UI bundles over the edge with hub-issued grants\n\nAn org-owned provider''s micro-frontend was never reachable: the UI proxy\nresolved /ui/providers/{name} platform-only, and the infrastructure\noperator rendered the serve pod without FAROS_PROVIDER_KUBECONFIG, so its\nheartbeat carried no bearer, an enforcing hub answered 401, the platform\nrecord went stale, and the portal saw 503 for the bundle.\n\n- providers/infrastructure/operator: set FAROS_PROVIDER_KUBECONFIG on the\n  serve deployment so the SDK heartbeat authenticates with the minted\n  provider kubeconfig.\n- pkg/hub/providers: add POST /api/providers/{name}/ui-grant, a sealed\n  short-lived grant minted for the caller''s (user, org, workspace) that the\n  UI proxy redeems into a delegated token and serves over the org''s edge\n  hop, the same boundary as the backend proxy. The bundle is SRI-hashed\n  through the caller''s delegated route at grant time. Grant-less URLs stay\n  platform-scoped.\n- portal: resolve an org-owned provider''s bundle URL and pin through the\n  grant before injecting the script; the loader accepts an explicit src.\n- docs: replace the ''provider UI is not portable'' known gap with the\n  grant design.\n\n* Fix CI: conformance regexes follow the bundle resolver; no nil contexts in grant tests\n\nThe portal conformance tests pinned the exact loadProviderScript call\nshape; update them to the resolveProviderBundle step that now precedes it.\nstaticcheck SA1012 flagged nil contexts passed to DelegatedProofKey in the\ngrant tests.","tree":{"sha":"4fa1b59472bf80962a9b683dc5b76803d884b36b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/git/trees/4fa1b59472bf80962a9b683dc5b76803d884b36b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-infrastructure/git/commits/4b59d1643735c2982a0bcc7ddc6088d7679d4204","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":fal