tml_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-code/commit/ba93a1ca67aa96feffd8362356b53a3e0dbb9c73","sha":"ba93a1ca67aa96feffd8362356b53a3e0dbb9c73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/commits/ba93a1ca67aa96feffd8362356b53a3e0dbb9c73"}],"sha":"3fa6c23dacef9a91f55465e3c0d859e06d3d3a0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/commits/3fa6c23dacef9a91f55465e3c0d859e06d3d3a0f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/commits/ba93a1ca67aa96feffd8362356b53a3e0dbb9c73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T08:26:01Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T08:26:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"cli: regroup the command tree, add connect/org/workspace members/whoami; tenant cluster-ID headers and provider fixes (#704)\n\nCLI (pkg/cli, test/e2e/suites/cli, docs/cli):\n- Group `faros --help` by intent; make --insecure-skip-tls-verify global;\n  hide legacy spellings (list/ls, kubeconfig edge, get, apply, get-token)\n  and move kcp workspace navigation to hidden `kcp-workspace`.\n- New: whoami, logout, token [--refresh], connect/disconnect (merged\n  faros-<edge> context), edge kubeconfig [-o|--merge], org list|create,\n  workspace list|create, and members list|add|remove|set-role at org and\n  workspace scope over the existing hub REST API.\n- Shared -o wide|json|yaml|name output, --yes confirmations, shell\n  completion for edge names, roles and formats.\n- Fix edge type detection (spec.type no longer exists), hub commands\n  following an edge context after connect, un-externalized proxy URLs,\n  and the error when the edges provider is not enabled.\n- Generated CLI reference (faros docs, make docs-cli, verify-docs-cli in\n  make verify); e2e suite test/e2e/suites/cli (make e2e-cli + CI job) with\n  a two-user hub, the edges provider, an in-process sshd and kind.\n- Refresh-token flow covered by tests against a fake OIDC issuer.\n- Fix install.sh archive names and next steps; dex examples now register\n  faros as a PKCE public client (public: true).\n\nHub and providers:\n- The hub proxy and MCP federation send the kcp cluster ID in\n  X-Faros-Tenant / X-Faros-Cluster and never the workspace path;\n  providers resolve org/workspace via provider-sdk/tenantaccess.\n  BREAKING for providers that parse a path from X-Faros-Tenant: roll\n  providers out before the hub.\n- Delegated provider tokens may read org/workspace rosters and invite to\n  an org (App Studio grants).\n- provider-sdk/apiexportprovider: apiexport multicluster provider that\n  retries failed endpoint watches, with a readiness check; adopted by the\n  hub and providers.\n- Edges: Workload spec.targetNamespace and simple.imagePullSecrets,\n  pod-template metadata preserved, cross-namespace pruning, agent\n  hostname reporting, stdin for ssh exec, backoff for service probes.\n- Kuery: key engaged clusters by cluster ID with an orphan sweep;\n  kuery_query MCP tool takes spec as an object.\n- Agents, App Studio, code: status stamping, GET-by-name routes,\n  publishing mode reporting, invite and preview fixes, build.yaml default.","tree":{"sha":"82419f3d3b61fba66eae089160189dc6320d2f9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/git/trees/82419f3d3b61fba66eae089160189dc6320d2f9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/git/commits/ba93a1ca67aa96feffd8362356b53a3e0dbb9c73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-code/commit/ba93a1ca67aa96feffd8362356b53a3e0dbb9c73","node_id":"C_kwDOS3qaztoAKGJhOTNhMWNhNjdhYTk2ZmVmZmQ4MzYyMzU2YjUzYTNlMGRiYjljNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-code/commit/d7cc0c89ada2aa67fd1ff1d8820660dec489d223","sha":"d7cc0c89ada2aa67fd1ff1d8820660dec489d223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/commits/d7cc0c89ada2aa67fd1ff1d8820660dec489d223"}],"sha":"ba93a1ca67aa96feffd8362356b53