* Align Git and AI setup step layouts and actions\n\n* Default Tilt universal sandbox to off with explicit opt-in\n\n* Harden Git reconnect recovery and capture frontend audit evidence\n\nRequire create-only Git repositories and expose safe recovery for unconfirmed creation. Include frontend audit evidence and portal lockfile updates.\n\nValidation: Git reconnect regression tests, browser checks, typecheck, build budgets, design gates, and changed-code lint passed.\n\n* Remove unrelated audit artifacts and lockfile changes from optional Git PR\n\n* Explain Git requirements for production publishing","tree":{"sha":"42c984cd6820fddfd16370e512590ce34661c6d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/git/trees/42c984cd6820fddfd16370e512590ce34661c6d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/git/commits/c2b9c99491c60b2acda80fadd4ad1e533ab42df9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-code/commi