9e7308bd33a0a775bac880a024bc58f8c59b0ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/commits/e9e7308bd33a0a775bac880a024bc58f8c59b0ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/commits/6d8319e7a2d353232eadd6dd7d753f6d50a73494/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T13:37:45Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T13:37:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(providers): address tenant workspaces by cluster ID, not path (#381)\n\nThe hub proxy''s membership gate (Option A, #361) rejects path-form\n/clusters/<root:...> addressing with a 403 (\"address workspaces by\ncluster ID, not by path\"). Several provider surfaces still built kcp\nrequest URLs from the X-Kedge-Tenant workspace path instead of the\nX-Kedge-Cluster logical-cluster ID the hub injects alongside it, so\ntenant requests — including App Studio commits — failed in production.\n\n- app-studio: build the MCP virtual-workspace URL from id.clusterID\n  (was id.tenantPath) and guard a missing X-Kedge-Cluster.\n- code provider: capture X-Kedge-Cluster and address the tenant client\n  by ID. The commit-bundle scope is re-keyed to the cluster ID from the\n  created CR''s kcp.io/cluster annotation, so it is unaffected.\n- infrastructure provider: same for the MCP tenant client and the\n  (currently unused) ResolveCloudCredentials. The data plane already\n  addressed by ID; corrected its stale \"may contain colons\" comment.\n- delete the dead app-studio path-form tenant ClientFactory; the live\n  path is the GraphQL gateway, already keyed by cluster ID.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2304ebbb70c78ec200e73f4cfb5d0ebd01fe861a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/git/trees/2304ebbb70c78ec200e73f4cfb5d0ebd01fe861a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/git/commits/6d8319e7a2d353232eadd6dd7d753f6d50a73494","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-code/commit/6d8319e7a2d353232eadd6dd7d753f6d50a73494","node_id":"C_kwDOS3qaztoAKDZkODMxOWU3YTJkMzUzMjMyZWFkZDZkZDdkNzUzZjZkNTBhNzM0OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-code/commit/82c324f57d67e6263c1314eb090cd7a18f02e068","sha":"82c324f57d67e6263c1314eb090cd7a18f02e068","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/commits/82c324f57d67e6263c1314eb090cd7a18f02e068"}],"sha":"6d8319e7a2d353232eadd6dd7d753f6d50a73494","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/commits/6d8319e7a2d353232eadd6dd7d753f6d50a73494"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/commits/82c324f57d67e6263c1314eb090cd7a18f02e068/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T13:09:58Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T13:09:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(code): surface conditions in the portal and replace native confirm dialogs (#380)\n\nConditions are now debuggable from the UI for all three resource kinds:\n- Extract the connection detail''s conditions table into a shared\n  ConditionsPanel component (Type/Status/Reason/Message/Since + a\n  \"controller has not caught up\" generation-lag warning).\n- Add a RepositoryDetail shape (conditions + observedGeneration) and render\n  the panel on the repository detail page, so EnsureFailed/DeleteFailed\n  reasons (e.g. the 403 delete-permission error) are visible in the portal.\n- Surface each Package''s Ready condition as a Status column (synced/pending/\n  error with the crawler message on hover) in both the repo and the\n  workspace-wide Packages views.\n\nReplace every window.confirm() with an in-app modal:\n- Promise-based confirmDialog() backed by a single ConfirmDialog mounted at\n  the app root; Enter confirms, Escape/backdrop cancels, confirm button\n  auto-focused, destructive actions styled danger.\n- Convert all delete/remove/connection-switch call sites. No UI component\n  uses alert()/confirm()/prompt() anymore.\n\nModal styles live in style.css, namespaced under kedge-provider-code and\nusing the existing --color-* tokens; the dialog renders inside the light-DOM\nelement (no body teleport) so theme tokens and namespaced CSS still apply.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72afd7dca1c8ea71f5944d81466a6b8540597a83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/git/trees/72afd7dca1c8ea71f5944d81466a6b8540597a83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/git/commits/82c324f57d67e6263c1314eb090cd7a18f02e068","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/use