ents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/commits/666023d5e60559d18b9d1250bde2eaaab1aaa5f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T09:51:14Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T09:51:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(code): request delete_repo scope so the provider can delete repos (#378)\n\nGitHub''s `repo` OAuth scope grants full control of private repositories but\nspecifically excludes deletion, which requires the separate `delete_repo`\nscope. Tokens minted with the old default set could create repositories but\nevery DELETE returned `403 Must have admin rights to Repository`, leaving\nRepository CRs stuck on their finalizer.\n\nAdd `delete_repo` to the default scope set in the OAuth handler, the Helm\nvalues doc, and the README PAT/env guidance. Existing connections must\nre-authorize (OAuth) or swap to a `delete_repo`-capable PAT to pick up the\nbroader scope.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e22a9c2f66d7a530fd67b89144cd914195687c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/git/trees/5e22a9c2f66d7a530fd67b89144cd914195687c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/git/commits/666023d5e60559d18b9d1250bde2eaaab1aaa5f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-code/commit/666023d5e60559d18b9d1250bde2eaaab1aaa5f5","node_id":"C_kwDOS3qaztoAKDY2NjAyM2Q1ZTYwNTU5ZDE4YjlkMTI1MGJkZTJlYWFhYjFhYWE1ZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-code/commit/2008506362f2201ac65f64f8c43858e1387fb46a","sha":"2008506362f2201ac65f64f8c43858e1387fb46a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/commits/2008506362f2201ac65f64f8c43858e1387fb46a"}],"sha":"666023d5e60559d18b9d1250bde2eaaab1aaa5f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-code/commits/666023d5e60559d18b9d1250bde2eaaab1aaa5f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5685031?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cwilhit","id":5685031,"login":"cwilhit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODUwMzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/received_events","repos_