zing and explicit\n  cell grid for Fig 4 pass/fail matrix\n- flagbench/adapters/unleash_sim.py: simulated Unleash with 3 documented\n  correctness gaps for paper comparison\n- flagbench/harness.py: add unleash_sim to adapter choices\n- docs/adapter_guide.md: full integration guide with LaunchDarkly,\n  Unleash, and REST API copy-paste examples\n- README.md: clarify adapter concept (resolve() is a bridge you write),\n  step-by-step instructions, what-you-get-back section","tree":{"sha":"00f78e1cf45fd905cf3bd632c9de6f9148a5ff02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanFedytskyi/flagbench/git/trees/00f78e1cf45fd905cf3bd632c9de6f9148a5ff02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanFedytskyi/flagbench/git/commits/172a4374a18269fd699b4c3138cd3a507aa19958","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15038371?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanFedytskyi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanFedytskyi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanFedytskyi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanFedytskyi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanFedytskyi","id":15038371,"login":"RomanFedytskyi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDM4Mzcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanFedytskyi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanFedytskyi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanFedytskyi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanFedytskyi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanFedytskyi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanFedytskyi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RomanFedytskyi/flagbench/commit/172a4374a18269fd699b4c3138cd3a507aa19958","node_id"