":"2026-06-11T20:33:52Z","email":"metecantekin@gmail.com","name":"Mete Cantekin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T20:33:52Z","email":"metecantekin@gmail.com","name":"Mete Cantekin"},"message":"feat: Scenario C alignment + Faz A v2 implementation + A6 CPU-scale runs (v2.1.0)\n\nTek commit''te üç aşama (squash — ilk public push):\n1) Scenario C paradigm alignment (21 May 2026 frozen decision) — additive,\n   v1.0.0 modülleri byte-identical korundu.\n2) Faz A (A5): v2 scaffold stub''ları NumPy referans implementasyonlarına\n   dönüştürüldü (federated, multimodal, rl_agents, rl_environment, xai;\n   unit testli, stub kalmadı).\n3) Faz A (A6): CPU-ölçek federe koşular — experiments/faz_a_staged.py +\n   faz_a_config.py + results/*.json (seed''li: random/central/FedAvg/\n   FedProx/FedProx+DP) + PPO sağlamlaştırma (reward_scale, grad-norm clip).\nRepo özeti (BB3):\n- src/federated/: FedAvg + FedProx (pilot konsorsiyumu, DP kancası)\n- src/multimodal/: PPG/ECG/EEG Bi-LSTM encoder''ları + fusion\n- src/rl_agents/ppo_actor_critic.py: NumPy PPO (4 eylem sınıfı)\n- src/rl_environment/pilot_state_env.py: PilotStateEnv (seeded)\n- src/xai/: SHAP + Counterfactual + LIME\n- experiments/: A6 koşuları + sample_decisions.json\n- arxiv-source/: BB3 preprint v2.1 LaTeX kaynağı\n- v1.0.0 modülleri (synthetic_data, anonymization, cryptography) değişmedi;\n  1179-kayıt referans veri seti aynı\n- tests: 11/11 yeşil · CHANGELOG [2.1.0]\n\nRefs: docs/scenario_c_paradigm_context.md, CHANGELOG.md","tree":{"sha":"2177ce039c1bb3bd474a97f7d9d586b54011de14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Orfeomete/cdsa-bb3/git/trees/2177ce039c1bb3bd474a97f7d9d586b54011de14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Orfeomete/cdsa-bb3/git/commits/d53474dee5dd7c3892ed2a17027d8cfa8b0646e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105606866?v=4","events_url":"https://api