:1266822598,"sha":"d6aebf9733b10a5b69355a43324f877e88396b31"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"alphadx","providerType":"User"},"email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"AlphaDx"},"authoredDate":"2026-06-12T01:37:50Z","committedDate":"2026-06-12T01:37:50Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:24:31.842Z","repositoryId":1266822598,"sha":"a05f7303ce2d782a8f4b23acbd102a5c7b3ed730"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:24:31.842Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/32805cd62bc5392e9fb85c24f950f2ba0b288eda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T17:15:26Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T17:15:26Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"He implementado completamente la funcionalidad de edición de rúbricas existentes via iframe con las siguientes mejoras:\n\n## Cambios realizados\n\n### 1. `src/src/app/(embed)/rubricas/page.tsx`\n- **Soporte para `mode=editar&id=ID`**: Permite abrir directamente el formulario de edición de una rúbrica existente\n- **`handleEditarInit()`**: Carga los datos de la rúbrica desde la API y pre-carga el formulario\n- **postMessage diferenciado**:\n  - `evalua.rubrica.created` → cuando se crea una rúbrica nueva\n  - `evalua.rubrica.updated` → cuando se edita una rúbrica existente\n- **Inclusión del `rubricaId`**: Ambos mensajes incluyen el ID de la rúbrica en el payload\n- **Vista éxito parametrizada**: Muestra \"Rúbrica Creada\" o \"Rúbrica Actualizada\" según corresponda\n- **Información de versión**: Incluye el número de versión cuando está disponible\n\n### 2. `documentacion/integracion-iframe.md`\n- Agregada la ruta `/rubricas?mode=editar&id=ID&jwt=TOKEN` en la tabla de rutas\n- Documentado el nuevo tipo de mensaje `evalua.rubrica.updated`\n- Agregado el Flujo 5 completo con diagrama de secuencia\n- Explicado el comportamiento del versionamiento:\n  - Si la rúbrica NO tiene evaluaciones → se actualiza en lugar (mismo `_id`)\n  - Si la rúbrica TIENE evaluaciones → se crea nueva versión (nuevo `_id`)\n- Ejemplos de listener para capturar eventos de actualización\n- Listener combinado (crear + editar)\n\n### 3. `documentacion/ejemplos-integracion.md`\n- Agregada la función `editar_rubrica()` en el ejemplo de Python/Flask\n- Muestra cómo construir la URL con los parámetros `mode=editar&id={rubrica_id}`\n\n### 4. `demo/views/site/rubricas.php`\n- Actualizado el listener de postMessage para capturar ambos eventos\n- Mensajes diferenciados:\n  - \"Nueva rúbrica creada: {id}\"\n  - \"Rúbrica actualizada: {id} (v{version})\"\n- Muestra el número de versión cuando está disponible en el payload\n\n## Uso\n\nPara editar una rúbrica desde el Host:\n```\nhttp://evalua:3000/rubricas?mode=editar&id=RUBRICA_ID&jwt=YOUR_JWT\n```\n\nEl Host puede escuchar ambos eventos:\n```javascript\nwindow.addEventListener(''message'', (event) => {\n  if (event.source === ''evalua'') {\n    if (event.data.type === ''evalua.rubrica.created'') {\n      console.log(''Nueva rúbrica:'', event.data.payload.rubricaId);\n    }\n    if (event.data.type === ''evalua.rubrica.updated'') {\n      console.log(''Rúbrica actualizada:'', event.data.payload.rubricaId);\n      console.log(''Versión:'', event.data.payload.version);\n    }\n  }\n});\n```\n\nLa implementación respeta las mismas reglas de seguridad (JWT, validación de permisos) y mantiene consistencia con el flujo de creación existente.","tree":{"sha":"d65351a6961fecb6cfa574384f726f9cdbb7c9b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/d65351a6961fecb6cfa574384f726f9cdbb7c9b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/32805cd62bc5392e9fb85c24f950f2ba0b288eda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/32805cd62bc5392e9fb85c24f950f2ba0b288eda","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKDMyODA1Y2Q2MmJjNTM5MmU5ZmI4NWMyNGY5NTBmMmJhMGIyODhlZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/a34aa2adf02e350ec2ad42eb57416f0b1b518124","sha":"a34aa2adf02e350ec2ad42eb57416f0b1b518124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/a34aa2adf02e350ec2ad42eb57416f0b1b518124"}],"sha":"32805cd62bc5392e9fb85c24f950f2ba0b288eda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/32805cd62bc5392e9fb85c24f950f2ba0b288eda"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/a34aa2adf02e350ec2ad42eb57416f0b1b518124/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T08:24:04Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T08:24:04Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Implementación completa. Resumen de cambios:\n\n### `src/src/app/(embed)/rubricas/page.tsx`\n- Importa `useSearchParams` y `Suspense` de Next.js\n- Lee el query param `mode=crear` para abrir directamente el formulario de creación (sin pasar por la lista)\n- Agregado estado `\"exito\"` al tipo `Vista` con pantalla de confirmación que muestra el ID de la rúbrica creada\n- Al guardar con `mode=crear`: muestra pantalla de éxito y envía `postMessage` con tipo `evalua.rubrica.created` — **no vuelve al índice**\n- Wrapping con `<Suspense>` (buena práctica de Next.js App Router)\n\n### `documentacion/integracion-iframe.md`\n- Nueva ruta en tabla: `/rubricas?mode=crear&jwt=TOKEN`\n- Nuevo Flujo 4: \"Crear rúbrica directo (sin índice)\" con diagrama completo\n- Tabla de postMessage actualizada con tipos v3.0 (`evalua.rubrica.created`, `evalua.evaluation.completed`)\n- Ejemplo de listener del Host para recibir la notificación\n\n### `documentacion/ejemplos-integracion.md`\n- Ruta `/crear-rubrica` agregada en ejemplos de Flask (Python) y Express (Node.js)\n\n### Uso desde el Host:\n```\niframe src=\"http://evalua:3000/rubricas?mode=crear&jwt=TOKEN\"\n```\n\nEl Host escucha el resultado:\n```js\nwindow.addEventListener(''message'', (event) => {\n  if (event.data.type === ''evalua.rubrica.created'') {\n    console.log(''Rúbrica creada:'', event.data.payload.rubricaId);\n    cerrarModal(); // El Host controla la navegación\n  }\n});\n```","tree":{"sha":"85f39052afcd4eda6261f41e6908fa264ea42762","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/85f39052afcd4eda6261f41e6908fa264ea42762"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/a34aa2adf02e350ec2ad42eb57416f0b1b518124","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/a34aa2adf02e350ec2ad42eb57416f0b1b518124","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKGEzNGFhMmFkZjAyZTM1MGVjMmFkNDJlYjU3NDE2ZjBiMWI1MTgxMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/f1cc0a6415e524e7105b8be8dc65e6f39d4ccb08","sha":"f1cc0a6415e524e7105b8be8dc65e6f39d4ccb08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/f1cc0a6415e524e7105b8be8dc65e6f39d4ccb08"}],"sha":"a34aa2adf02e350ec2ad42eb57416f0b1b518124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/a34aa2adf02e350ec2ad42eb57416f0b1b518124"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/f1