ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/6d29c99bd0181e89e2dff1ecac8ba5e61c657b13","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKDZkMjljOTliZDAxODFlODllMmRmZjFlY2FjOGJhNWU2MWM2NTdiMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/8ceb6c5ea993d8e1d66bef9969596204d66e8065","sha":"8ceb6c5ea993d8e1d66bef9969596204d66e8065","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/8ceb6c5ea993d8e1d66bef9969596204d66e8065"}],"sha":"6d29c99bd0181e89e2dff1ecac8ba5e61c657b13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/6d29c99bd0181e89e2dff1ecac8ba5e61c657b13"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/8ceb6c5ea993d8e1d66bef9969596204d66e8065/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T21:13:31Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T21:13:31Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"## Implementación completa: Exigencia configurable por rúbrica\n\n### Causa original del bug\nLa fórmula de cálculo convertía notas a \"logro\" [0,1] y aplicaba una transformación no-lineal por tramos con exigencia fija en 0.6 (60%). Con notas 7.0 y 4.0 al 50% cada una, esto producía **5.13** en vez del **5.50** esperado.\n\n### Cambios realizados (8 archivos)\n\n| Archivo | Cambio |\n|---------|--------|\n| `src/domain/strategies/evaluacion-strategy.ts` | Restaurado algoritmo logro/exigencia, default cambiado de 0.6 → **0.5** |\n| `src/domain/entities/rubrica.ts` | Nuevo campo `exigencia: number` en constructor y `create()`, propagado en `clonarParaNuevaVersion()` |\n| `src/infrastructure/database/models/rubrica.model.ts` | Campo `exigencia` en schema Mongoose (default 0.5, min 0.1, max 1.0) + interfaz |\n| `src/domain/schemas.ts` | `exigencia` en `CrearRubricaSchema` (default 0.5) y `ActualizarRubricaSchema` |\n| `src/app/api/rubricas/route.ts` | Guarda `exigencia` al crear rúbrica |\n| `src/app/api/rubricas/[id]/route.ts` | Actualiza `exigencia` en PUT (directa y versionamiento) |\n| `src/app/api/evaluaciones/[id]/calcular/route.ts` | Lee `exigencia` de la rúbrica y la pasa a `strategy.calcular()` |\n| `src/app/(embed)/evaluar/page.tsx` | Lee `exigencia` de la rúbrica y la pasa a `notaFinalProvisional` |\n| `src/app/(embed)/rubricas/page.tsx` | Campo `exigencia (%)` editable en formulario de crear/editar |\n| `all-in-one/entrypoint.sh` | Seed de `exigencia_default` (0.5) en colección `configuraciones` |\n\n### Verificación con tu caso\nCon exigencia 50%, notas 7.0 y 4.0 al 50%:\n- Logro₁ = 1.0, Logro₂ = 0.5, P = 0.75\n- P ≥ 0.5 → Nota = 4.0 + 3.0×((0.75-0.5)/0.5) = **5.50** ✓","tree":{"sha":"972744c96c93f2076f262650db831973ff874105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/972744c96c93f2076f262650db831973ff874105"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/8ceb6c5ea993d8e1d66bef9969596204d66e8065","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/8ceb6c5ea993d8e1d66bef9969596204d66e8065","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKDhjZWI2YzVlYTk5M2Q4ZTFkNjZiZWY5OTY5NTk2MjA0ZDY2ZTgwNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/33c7e341b833206337751c1fb0dc8085822db701","sha":"33c7e341b833206337751c1fb0dc8085822db701","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/33c7e341b833206337751c1fb0dc8085822db701"}],"sha":"8ceb6c5ea993d8e1d66bef9969596204d66e8065","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/8ceb6c5ea993d8e1d66bef9969596204d66e8065"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"