hubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/1f9443f73488761e6793bde06f229e19e06fb100/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T02:24:18Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T02:24:18Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Se implementaron dos mejoras principales:\n\n### 1. Vista de Resultados — \"Motivo de la calificación\"\nEn `v0/src/app/(embed)/resultado/page.tsx`, al expandir un criterio ahora se muestra al final del detalle un bloque destacado con:\n- Borde izquierdo naranja (`--color-evalUA1`)\n- Encabezado \"💬 Motivo de la calificación:\"\n- Texto de la observación del evaluador (campo `observaciones` del `Puntaje`)\n\nEsto permite al evaluado entender la justificación individual de cada nota asignada.\n\n### 2. Wizard de Evaluación — Feedback de confirmación\nEn `v0/src/app/(embed)/evaluar/page.tsx`:\n\n- **Toast al calificar descriptor:** Al seleccionar una nota, aparece un toast animado (1.8s) en la parte superior con el formato \"✓ {Criterio}: Nota {n} — {Etiqueta}\" usando fondo verde. Esto confirma explícitamente qué fue lo que se guardó.\n- **Toast al guardar observación:** Al guardar una observación por criterio, aparece un toast \"✓ Observación guardada para {Nombre del criterio}\".\n- **Mejora del panel de observaciones:** Se reemplazó el botón único \"✓ Listo\" por dos botones: \"Cancelar\" (outline) y \"✓ Guardar observación\" (primario), proporcionando un flujo más claro y evitando confusiones.\n- **Preservación de observaciones:** Al re-calificar un criterio, la observación existente se preserva en lugar de perderse.\n\n### Documentación actualizada\n`documentacion/03-vistas-frontend.md` se actualizó con:\n- Descripción del bloque \"Motivo de la calificación\" en §3.3 (Vista de Resultados)\n- Descripción del toast de confirmación de score en §3.2 (Wizard, punto 2)\n- Nuevo punto 5 sobre \"Feedback de Observaciones por Criterio\" en §3.2","tree":{"sha":"ae3a30c1b63b94bd3acad5093d5b38d812743532","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/ae3a30c1b63b94bd3acad5093d5b38d812743532"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/1f9443f73488761e6793bde06f229e19e06fb100","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/1f9443f73488761e6793bde06f229e19e06fb100","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKDFmOTQ0M2Y3MzQ4ODc2MWU2NzkzYmRlMDZmMjI5ZTE5ZTA2ZmIxMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/505f7597e7a38fa16b046a697c38dda7c1f01cbd","sha":"505f7597e7a38fa16b046a697c38dda7c1f01cbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/505f7597e7a38fa16b046a697c38dda7c1f01cbd"}],"sha":"1f9443f73488761e6793bde06f229e19e06fb100","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/1f9443f73488761e6793bde06f229e19e06fb100"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/505f7597e7a38fa16b046a697c38dda7c1f01cbd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T01:29:05Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T01:29:05Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Se actualizaron dos archivos:\n\n**1. `v0/src/app/(embed)/rubricas/page.tsx`** — Implementación del header sticky para criterios.\n\n**2. `documentacion/03-vistas-frontend.md`** — Dos cambios documentales:\n\n- **Punto 8 actualizado** en \"Diseño del Formulario Crear/Editar (Accordion)\": describe el patrón de header sticky con sus propiedades técnicas (`position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 5`), fondo sólido, borde de separación y márgenes compensados.\n\n- **Nueva sección \"Consideraciones de Diseño para Elementos Sticky en Viewports Embebidos\"**: documenta 6 puntos relevantes para futuros desarrolladores:\n  1. **Stacking de sticky elements** — cómo coexisten header y footer sticky con `top`/`bottom` diferentes y z-index distintos.\n  2. **Fondo sólido obligatorio** — sin `backgroundColor`, el sticky se vuelve translúcido y confunde visualmente.\n  3. **Márgenes compensados** — técnica de `margin: 0 -0.75rem` + `padding` para anular el `px-3` del padre y extender el sticky a todo el ancho.\n  4. **\"Datos Generales\" fuera del sticky** — decisión intencional para no consumir espacio vertical fijo; en modo \"editar\" viene colapsada por defecto.\n  5. **Alternativa CSS Grid** — si se necesitan más de 2 zonas sticky, evaluar migrar a `grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto` por compatibilidad con navegadores antiguos.\n  6. **Pruebas recomendadas** — verificar con 1 y 15+ criterios, y que `scrollIntoView` no entre en conflicto con la posición sticky.","tree":{"sha":"d220425df14d18374ba45118ef9047b5a20328ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/d220425df14d18374ba45118ef9047b5a20328ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/505f7597e7a38fa16b046a697c38dda7c1f01cbd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/505f7597e7a38fa16b046a697c38dda7c1f01cbd","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKDUwNWY3NTk3ZTdhMzhmYTE2YjA0NmE2OTdjMzhkZGE3YzFmMDFjYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/b79d12ba0d7ea8c698001e9c8a1b958f4d749158","sha":"b79d12ba0d7ea8c698001e9c8a1b958f4d749158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/b79d12ba0d7ea8c698001e9c8a1b958f4d749158"}],"sha":"505f7597e7a38fa16b046a697c38dda7c1f01cbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/505f7597e7a38fa16b046a697c38dda7c1f01cbd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/b79d12ba0d7ea8c698001e9c8a1b958f4d749158/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T01:26:27Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T01:26:27Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Se hizo sticky el header de criterios (\"Criterios\", badge Σ, botón \"+ Criterio\") dentro del contenedor scrolleable de la vista crear/editar de rúbricas.\n\n**Cambios realizados en `v0/src/app/(embed)/rubricas/page.tsx`:**\n\nAl div del header de criterios (línea ~360) se le agregaron estilos inline:\n- `position: sticky` + `top: 0` → se mantiene fijo en la parte superior del área scrolleable\n- `zIndex: 5` → se dibuja encima del contenido que pasa por debajo\n- `backgroundColor: \"var(--embed-bg)\"` → fondo sólido para no ser transparente\n- Margen horizontal negativo (`-0.75rem`) + padding horizontal compensatorio → se extiende a todo el ancho ignorando el `px-3` del padre\n- Borde inferior sutil para separación visual\n\n**Resultado:** Al hacer scroll hacia abajo con muchos criterios, tanto el botón \"+ Criterio\" como el contador de criterios y el badge Σ permanecen siempre visibles en la parte superior. El footer con \"Guardar Rúbrica\" ya era sticky por abajo. Ahora ambos extremos de la jerarquía son siempre accesibles.","tree":{"sha":"1f366bfdff72dc8a02dd1eb032727fc44c2fced6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/1f366bfdff72dc8a02dd1eb032727fc44c2fced6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/b79d12ba0d7ea8c698001e9c8a1b958f4d749158","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/b79d12ba0d7ea8c698001e9c8a1b958f4d749158","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKGI3OWQxMmJhMGQ3ZWE4YzY5ODAwMWU5YzhhMWI5NThmNGQ3NDkxNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/cb26b7a26f0b7b4a0cc6fba5ce6af3d55b2c9ec9","sha":"cb26b7a26f0b7b4a0cc6fba5ce6af3d55b2c9ec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/cb26b7a26f0b7b4a0cc6fba5ce6af3d55b2c9ec9"}],"sha":"b79d12ba0d7ea8c698001e9c8a1b958f4d749158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/b79d12ba0d7ea8c698001e9c8a1b958f4d749158"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/cb26b7a26f0b7b4a0cc6fba5ce6af3d55b2c9ec9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T01:14:55Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T01:14:55Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Se actualizaron los siguientes documentos de la documentación para reflejar los cambios de `notaAprobacion` y `notaCorte`:\n\n**01-base-de-datos.md:**\n- Diagrama Mermaid de clases: `Rubrica` ahora incluye `+number notaAprobacion`, `Criterio` incluye `+number notaCorte`\n- Schema Mongoose `CriterioSchema`: nuevo campo `notaCorte: { type: Number, default: 4.0, min: 1.0, max: 7.0 }`\n- Schema Mongoose `RubricaSchema`: nuevo campo `notaAprobacion: { type: Number, default: 4.0, min: 1.0, max: 7.0 }`\n\n**02-controladores-api.md:**\n- Endpoint `POST /api/rubricas`: documentados los campos configurables del payload (`notaAprobacion` a nivel rúbrica, `notaCorte` a nivel criterio excluyente)\n\n**03-vistas-frontend.md:**\n- Sección 3.2 Wizard: Barra de Cálculo Acumulado ahora documenta que usa `notaAprobacion` para aprobación y `notaCorte` para Gatekeeper\n- Pantalla de Resumen: documentado el Detalle del Cálculo con desglose ponderado, botón \"✏ Modificar\" por criterio, y comparaciones configurables\n- Sección 3.4 CRUD Rúbricas: documentados los campos `notaAprobacion` en formulario y `notaCorte` condicional al activar Gatekeeper, badge \"Excluyente (corte: X.X)\"\n\n**04-modelos-dominio.md** (ya actualizado previamente):\n- Glosario DDD: nuevos términos \"Nota de Aprobación\" y \"Nota de Corte\"\n- Código de entidades y estrategias actualizado con los nuevos campos\n\nTodos los documentos ahora reflejan la funcionalidad de umbrales configurables implementada en código.","tree":{"sha":"76f9eda227666a0170715e0a3a19d5dc47cda317","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/76f9eda227666a0170715e0a3a19d5dc47cda317"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/cb26b7a26f0b7b4a0cc6fba5ce6af3d55b2c9ec9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/cb26b7a26f0b7b4a0cc6fba5ce6af3d55b2c9ec9","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKGNiMjZiN2EyNmYwYjdiNGEwY2M2ZmJhNWNlNmFmM2Q1NWIyYzllYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/9bb90b1ac6c2b6227b067fe3525172c46e11ebe6","sha":"9bb90b1ac6c2b6227b067fe3525172c46e11ebe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/9bb90b1ac6c2b6227b067fe3525172c46e11ebe6"}],"sha":"cb26b7a26f0b7b4a0cc6fba5ce6af3d55b2c9ec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/cb26b7a26f0b7b4a0cc6fba5ce6af3d55b2c9ec9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/9bb90b1ac6c2b6227b067fe3525172c46e11ebe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T01:05:03Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T01:05:03Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Se corrigieron **4 problemas** en los archivos:\n\n### 1. `v0/src/app/api/embed/launch/route.ts`\n**Bug**: Al recuperar un borrador existente de Redis, no se devolvía el `rubricaId`, causando que el frontend no pudiera cargar la rúbrica.\n**Fix**: Se obtiene el borrador completo de Redis con `getDraft()` y se incluye `rubricaId` en la respuesta.\n\n### 2. `v0/src/app/(embed)/evaluar/page.tsx`\n**Bug**: Si el launch no devolvía `rubricaId`, la página quedaba vacía sin error explícito.\n**Fix**: Fallback defensivo que obtiene el `rubricaId` directamente desde `GET /api/evaluaciones/{id}`.\n\n### 3. `v0/src/app/(embed)/rubricas/page.tsx`\n**Bug**: Los 7 niveles de descriptores desbordaban el contenedor, ocultando el botón \"Guardar Rúbrica\".\n**Fix**: Se agregó `overflow-y-auto` con `maxHeight: 12rem` al contenedor de descriptores.\n\n### 4. `v0/src/app/(embed)/resultado/page.tsx` ← **Este era el error reportado**\n**Bug**: La página de resultados solo aceptaba `?id=`, `?evaluacion_id=` o `?evaluacionId=` como parámetros. No soportaba JWT (`?jwt=...`), que es la forma en que un ALUMNO accede.\n**Fix**: Se agrega soporte para JWT usando el endpoint `/api/embed/launch`:\n- Extrae `evaluacion_id` del JWT vía launch endpoint\n- Si el borrador está en Redis (no completada), redirige a `/evaluar?jwt=...` para que el alumno continúe\n- Si la evaluación ya está completada en MongoDB, muestra el resultado","tree":{"sha":"c58e074523b07ea0f21ab99e23a3587307c22c96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/c58e074523b07ea0f21ab99e23a3587307c22c96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/9bb90b1ac6c2b6227b067fe3525172c46e11ebe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/9bb90b1ac6c2b6227b067fe3525172c46e11ebe6","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKDliYjkwYjFhYzZjMmI2MjI3YjA2N2ZlMzUyNTE3MmM0NmUxMWViZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/e1d1a06d6b07a7817517fee79cd6c5c42e77e9af","sha":"e1d1a06d6b07a7817517fee79cd6c5c42e77e9af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/e1d1a06d6b07a7817517fee79cd6c5c42e77e9af"}],"sha":"9bb90b1ac6c2b6227b067fe3525172c46e11ebe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/9bb90b1ac6c2b6227b067fe3525172c46e11ebe6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/e1d1a06d6b07a7817517fee79cd6c5c42e77e9af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T01:04:40Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T01:04:40Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Actualización de la documentación","tree":{"sha":"0b6f62fd7dc471812c2959e5a198bfeb78f35c64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/0b6f62fd7dc471812c2959e5a198bfeb78f35c64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/e1d1a06d6b07a7817517fee79cd6c5c42e77e9af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/e1d1a06d6b07a7817517fee79cd6c5c42e77e9af","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKGUxZDFhMDZkNmIwN2E3ODE3NTE3ZmVlNzljZDZjNWM0MmU3N2U5YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/ed40c098bc030a93e70f5c1b5c0ac06b1dd74447","sha":"ed40c098bc030a93e70f5c1b5c0ac06b1dd74447","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/ed40c098bc030a93e70f5c1b5c0ac06b1dd74447"}],"sha":"e1d1a06d6b07a7817517fee79cd6c5c42e77e9af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/e1d1a06d6b07a7817517fee79cd6c5c42e77e9af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/ed40c098bc030a93e70f5c1b5c0ac06b1dd74447/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T01:03:01Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T01:03:01Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Mejoras en la interfaz de usuario: se actualizan las tarjetas de descriptores interactivas y se implementa un diseño de formulario tipo accordion para crear/editar rúbricas, optimizando la experiencia en el viewport de 466px.","tree":{"sha":"d29615b6699c5c96cab5e8280f80b45c60bfea90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/d29615b6699c5c96cab5e8280f80b45c60bfea90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/ed40c098bc030a93e70f5c1b5c0ac06b1dd74447","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/ed40c098bc030a93e70f5c1b5c0ac06b1dd74447","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKGVkNDBjMDk4YmMwMzBhOTNlNzBmNWMxYjVjMGFjMDZiMWRkNzQ0NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/42726d51227f41bbac53548b3efc9ac2189d0e27","sha":"42726d51227f41bbac53548b3efc9ac2189d0e27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/42726d51227f41bbac53548b3efc9ac2189d0e27"}],"sha":"ed40c098bc030a93e70f5c1b5c0ac06b1dd74447","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/ed40c098bc030a93e70f5c1b5c0ac06b1dd74447"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/42726d51227f41bbac53548b3efc9ac2189d0e27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T00:57:52Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T00:57:52Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Se corrigieron **3 problemas** en los archivos:\n\n### 1. Error al cargar evaluación recién creada — `v0/src/app/api/embed/launch/route.ts`\n\n**Causa raíz**: Cuando el JWT del ALUMNO contenía `evaluacion_id`, el endpoint `/api/embed/launch` verificaba si el borrador existía en Redis, pero **no devolvía el `rubricaId`** del borrador. El frontend (`evaluar/page.tsx`) necesitaba `data.rubricaId` para cargar la rúbrica y sin él, la página quedaba en un estado vacío sin error explícito.\n\n**Fix**: Se obtiene el borrador completo de Redis y se incluye `rubricaId` en la respuesta del launch.\n\n### 2. Fallback defensivo en frontend — `v0/src/app/(embed)/evaluar/page.tsx`\n\n**Fix**: Si por alguna razón el launch no devuelve `rubricaId` (edge case), el frontend ahora intenta obtenerlo directamente desde `GET /api/evaluaciones/{id}` como respaldo.\n\n### 3. Sección de descriptores no scrolleable — `v0/src/app/(embed)/rubricas/page.tsx`\n\n**Problema**: Los 7 niveles de descriptores ocupaban todo el espacio vertical, ocultando el botón \"Guardar Rúbrica\" del footer sticky.\n\n**Fix**: Se agregó `overflow-y-auto` con `maxHeight: 12rem` al contenedor de descriptores, permitiendo que se desplace internamente sin empujar el footer fuera de vista.","tree":{"sha":"f9b2b3a2952a8766db27e3d0b393f1e0aa7778bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/f9b2b3a2952a8766db27e3d0b393f1e0aa7778bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/42726d51227f41bbac53548b3efc9ac2189d0e27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/42726d51227f41bbac53548b3efc9ac2189d0e27","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKDQyNzI2ZDUxMjI3ZjQxYmJhYzUzNTQ4YjNlZmM5YWMyMTg5ZDBlMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/f9b06448ac3496b86ab657912c3410ad4e1041e4","sha":"f9b06448ac3496b86ab657912c3410ad4e1041e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/f9b06448ac3496b86ab657912c3410ad4e1041e4"}],"sha":"42726d51227f41bbac53548b3efc9ac2189d0e27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/42726d51227f41bbac53548b3efc9ac2189d0e27"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/f9b06448ac3496b86ab657912c3410ad4e1041e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T00:44:16Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T00:44:16Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Corregido el rendering de bullet points en la vista de evaluación (`v0/src/app/(embed)/evaluar/page.tsx`).\n\n**Cambio:** Los bullet points de los descriptores ahora se muestran como texto concatenado con guiones (\" — \") en una sola línea, en vez de spans individuales en flex-wrap.\n\n- Se filtran bullet points vacíos antes de renderizar\n- Los puntos se unen con `\" — \"` y se muestran en un `<span>` con `leading-snug`\n- El div crece naturalmente según el largo del texto (wrap automático)\n- Si no hay bullet points, no se renderiza el contenedor\n\n**Antes:** `{bulletPoints.map(bp => <span>• {bp}</span>)}` → spans separados, \"• \" sin texto cuando vacíos\n\n**Después:** `{bulletPoints.filter(bp => bp.trim()).join(\" — \")}` → \"Contenido completo — Análisis profundo — Fuentes confiables\"","tree":{"sha":"d10b84411c11ca5beb9a18e1a1be014f13e4fd43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/d10b84411c11ca5beb9a18e1a1be014f13e4fd43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/f9b06448ac3496b86ab657912c3410ad4e1041e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/f9b06448ac3496b86ab657912c3410ad4e1041e4","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKGY5YjA2NDQ4YWMzNDk2Yjg2YWI2NTc5MTJjMzQxMGFkNGUxMDQxZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/5102d9558ece0c3dc9a60c0fd89e1e7299c5502a","sha":"5102d9558ece0c3dc9a60c0fd89e1e7299c5502a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/5102d9558ece0c3dc9a60c0fd89e1e7299c5502a"}],"sha":"f9b06448ac3496b86ab657912c3410ad4e1041e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/f9b06448ac3496b86ab657912c3410ad4e1041e4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/5102d9558ece0c3dc9a60c0fd89e1e7299c5502a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T00:40:29Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T00:40:29Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Implementación completa del patrón accordion con scroll inteligente para la sección de rúbricas.\n\n### Cambios realizados en `v0/src/app/(embed)/rubricas/page.tsx`:\n\n**Accordion (un criterio a la vez):**\n- Estado `criterioActivoIdx: number | null` controla qué criterio está expandido\n- Criterios colapsados muestran resumen compacto: número, nombre, badges de tipo/peso/gatekeeper\n- Al hacer clic se expande el criterio activo y colapsan los demás\n- Borde naranja + sombra sutil marcan el criterio activo\n\n**Scroll-into-view:**\n- `useRef<Map<number, HTMLDivElement>>` registra cada card de criterio\n- Al expandir, `scrollIntoView({ behavior: ''smooth'', block: ''start'' })` lleva el criterio al viewport\n- Al agregar \"+ Criterio\", el nuevo se expande automáticamente y hace scroll\n\n**Footer sticky:**\n- Panel de Cancelar/Guardar con `position: sticky; bottom: 0; zIndex: 10`\n- Siempre visible sin importar la posición del scroll\n- `paddingBottom: 4rem` en el contenedor de scroll para evitar que contenido quede debajo\n\n**Datos generales colapsable:**\n- Toggle para mostrar/ocultar título y nota de aprobación\n- Cuando está colapsado, muestra el título como preview inline\n- Inicia abierto al crear, cerrado al editar\n\n**Indicador de progreso:**\n- Badge \"Criterio X de N\" en el header del criterio activo\n- Botón \"Siguiente criterio →\" al final de cada criterio activo (excepto el último)\n- Navegación fluida entre criterios con scroll automático\n\n**UX mejorada:**\n- Criterios colapsados son ultra compactos (~24px de alto cada uno)\n- Botón ✕ para eliminar en estado colapsado (con `stopPropagation`)\n- Los descriptores se muestran siempre dentro del criterio activo (sin sub-toggle)\n- Manejo correcto de índices al eliminar criterios intermedios","tree":{"sha":"da6e0d939d38f23707b1c1bdd00657dae3139e93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/da6e0d939d38f23707b1c1bdd00657dae3139e93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/5102d9558ece0c3dc9a60c0fd89e1e7299c5502a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/5102d9558ece0c3dc9a60c0fd89e1e7299c5502a","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKDUxMDJkOTU1OGVjZTBjM2RjOWE2MGMwZmQ4OWUxZTcyOTljNTUwMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/8b879be453e1fe018fd1f9e7f01e612db3d40bfb","sha":"8b879be453e1fe018fd1f9e7f01e612db3d40bfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/8b879be453e1fe018fd1f9e7f01e612db3d40bfb"}],"sha":"5102d9558ece0c3dc9a60c0fd89e1e7299c5502a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/5102d9558ece0c3dc9a60c0fd89e1e7299c5502a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/8b879be453e1fe018fd1f9e7f01e612db3d40bfb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T00:16:43Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T00:16:43Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Rediseño completo de la sección CRUD de Rúbricas. Se modificaron 2 archivos:\n\n### `v0/src/app/globals.css` — Nuevas clases CSS compactas\n- **`.embed-input-compact`** — inputs con padding reducido (0.35rem) y font-size xs\n- **`.embed-input-xs`** — inputs extra compactos para descriptores (h-6, 11px)\n- **`.embed-card-compact` + `.embed-card-accent`** — cards con barra de acento superior (verde=activa, gris=inactiva)\n- **`.embed-criterion-card`** — cards de criterio con borderRadius y padding compactos\n- **`.embed-descriptor-card`** con variantes `.level-high` (verde), `.level-mid` (amarillo), `.level-low` (rojo)\n- **`.embed-switch`** — toggle switch CSS puro (sin dependencias) con animación\n- **`.embed-badge-sm`** — badges ultra compactos con variantes success/warning/danger/primary/neutral\n\n### `v0/src/app/(embed)/rubricas/page.tsx` — Rediseño completo\n\n**Vista Crear/Editar:**\n- Inputs compactos (`embed-input-compact`) en grid `1fr auto auto auto`\n- Switch toggle para \"Excluyente (Gatekeeper)\" en vez de checkbox\n- Badge \"Gatekeeper\" rojo aparece al activar excluyente\n- Descriptores colapsados por defecto (botón toggle \"Descriptores (7 niveles)\")\n- Cards de descriptor con fondo coloreado según nivel (verde ≥5, amarillo 4, rojo <4)\n- Badges de nota coloreados (success/primary/danger)\n- Contador de ponderaciones inline con badge ✓/✗\n- Error display como alerta roja con fondo\n- Footer con Cancelar/Guardar\n\n**Vista Lista:**\n- Cards con accent bar superior (verde=activa, gris=inactiva)\n- Badges compactos (Activa/Inactiva, v{n}, N crit.)\n- ID en contenedor dashed con botón copiar\n- Criterios expandibles con animación\n- Botón Editar inline\n\nToda la lógica de negocio preservada: validación Σ=1.0, API POST/PUT, postMessage al host, copiar ID, edición de datos existentes.","tree":{"sha":"064d8ca44b40372ceb2b4e58ef58d1debee2db2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/064d8ca44b40372ceb2b4e58ef58d1debee2db2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/8b879be453e1fe018fd1f9e7f01e612db3d40bfb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/8b879be453e1fe018fd1f9e7f01e612db3d40bfb","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKDhiODc5YmU0NTNlMWZlMDE4ZmQxZjllN2YwMWU2MTJkYjNkNDBiZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/6995f77060cf0ec8ed59ad572e3ec9150923b8b2","sha":"6995f77060cf0ec8ed59ad572e3ec9150923b8b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/6995f77060cf0ec8ed59ad572e3ec9150923b8b2"}],"sha":"8b879be453e1fe018fd1f9e7f01e612db3d40bfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/8b879be453e1fe018fd1f9e7f01e612db3d40bfb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/fo