ons_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/6995f77060cf0ec8ed59ad572e3ec9150923b8b2","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKDY5OTVmNzcwNjBjZjBlYzhlZDU5YWQ1NzJlM2VjOTE1MDkyM2I4YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/ce2e130c37df74b50b305a5c2ca4983829de2393","sha":"ce2e130c37df74b50b305a5c2ca4983829de2393","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/ce2e130c37df74b50b305a5c2ca4983829de2393"}],"sha":"6995f77060cf0ec8ed59ad572e3ec9150923b8b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/6995f77060cf0ec8ed59ad572e3ec9150923b8b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/ce2e130c37df74b50b305a5c2ca4983829de2393/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T19:52:58Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T19:52:58Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Se creó `README.md` en la raíz del proyecto con la sección \"Estructura del proyecto\" que documenta los hallazgos del análisis de las cuatro carpetas:\n\n1. **`documentacion/`** — Hito base: 14 documentos técnicos que definen todo el sistema (base de datos, APIs, vistas, dominio DDD, historias de usuario, gobierno de datos, integración iframe, arquitectura SaaS, planificación de 14 semanas, matrices de riesgo, seguridad y entorno LLM).\n\n2. **`mockup/`** — Maqueta interactiva con Next.js 16 + Prisma/SQLite que simula todas las vistas del sistema (overview, dashboard, rúbricas, wizard, resultados, configuración) con datos mockeados y selector de roles JWT. Funciona como referencia UX para el desarrollo real.\n\n3. **`v0/`** — Desarrollo Alpha (WIP) con el stack de producción real: Next.js 15 + Mongoose/MongoDB + ioredis/Redis + Zustand + Zod. Implementa la arquitectura DDD documental con capas domain/infrastructure/app, Route Group `(embed)` para vistas embebidas, y Docker Compose con 3 servicios.\n\n4. **`demo/`** — Aplicación Host Yii2 (PHP) que integra evalUA vía iframe, generando JWT por rol (ADMINISTRADOR, MANTENEDOR, PROFESOR, ALUMNO) y comunicándose por postMessage.\n\nEl README incluye diagrama de relaciones, stack tecnológico resumido e instrucciones de inicio rápido para los tres modos de ejecución.","tree":{"sha":"efd5521831b9485e821f4e52a0106ad8c280014e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/efd5521831b9485e821f4e52a0106ad8c280014e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/ce2e130c37df74b50b305a5c2ca4983829de2393","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":n