/api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/37578a84633fbbece8355ff24247f847db6b3baf","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKDM3NTc4YTg0NjMzZmJiZWNlODM1NWZmMjQyNDdmODQ3ZGI2YjNiYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/6f3c1fd3218f5fd34d1fe6ff3353928b39d7c739","sha":"6f3c1fd3218f5fd34d1fe6ff3353928b39d7c739","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/6f3c1fd3218f5fd34d1fe6ff3353928b39d7c739"}],"sha":"37578a84633fbbece8355ff24247f847db6b3baf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/37578a84633fbbece8355ff24247f847db6b3baf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/6f3c1fd3218f5fd34d1fe6ff3353928b39d7c739/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T08:21:26Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T08:21:26Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"EvalUA v3.0 ha sido desarrollado exitosamente y está corriendo en Docker.\n\n## Arquitectura implementada\n\n**Stack:** Next.js 15 (App Router) + TypeScript 5 + Mongoose 8 + Redis (ioredis) + Zustand 5 + Framer Motion + Tailwind CSS v4\n\n**Docker Compose** con 3 servicios:\n- `evalua-app` → http://localhost:3000\n- `evalua-mongodb` → puerto 27017\n- `evalua-redis` → puerto 6379\n\n## Capas DDD implementadas\n\n### Domain Layer (`src/domain/`)\n- **Entidades:** Rubrica (aggregate root), Evaluacion (aggregate root), Criterio, Descriptor, Puntaje\n- **Value Object:** Nota (escala 1.0-7.0)\n- **Strategy:** EvaluacionStrategy (Gatekeeper + conversión por exigencia 60%)\n- **Branded Types:** RubricaId, CriterioId, EvaluacionId, UsuarioId\n- **Zod Schemas:** Validación de todos los inputs\n\n### Infrastructure Layer (`src/infrastructure/`)\n- **MongoDB:** Mongoose models con esquemas embebidos (criterios/descriptores en Rúbrica, puntajes en Evaluación)\n- **Redis:** Borradores con TTL 30 días, caché L2 de rúbricas (24h), configuraciones\n- **JWT:** Verificación HS256 con dev-mode bypass para desarrollo\n\n### API Routes (`src/app/api/`)\n- `POST /api/embed/launch` — Lanzamiento embebido con verificación JWT\n- `GET|POST /api/rubricas` — CRUD de rúbricas\n- `GET|PUT|DELETE /api/rubricas/[id]` — Detalle con Cache-Aside pattern\n- `POST /api/evaluaciones` — Crear borrador en Redis\n- `GET|PUT /api/evaluaciones/[id]` — Auto-save de borrador\n- `POST /api/evaluaciones/[id]/calcular` — Consolidación final con Gatekeeper\n- `GET /api/dashboard/metricas` — Métricas del sistema\n- `GET|PUT /api/configuracion` — Parámetros del sistema\n\n### Presentation Layer (`src/app/(embed)/`)\n- **`/evaluar`** — Wizard interactivo con Framer Motion, descriptores como tarjetas, auto-save, resumen con navegación interactiva, postMessage al host al finalizar\n- **`/resultado`** — Vista solo lectura con acordeón single-open\n- **`/rubricas`** — CRUD completo con versionamiento, copia de UUID\n- **`/dashboard`** — Tarjetas de métricas e historial reciente\n- **`/configurar`** — Panel de parámetros (solo ADMINISTRADOR)\n\n### Reglas de negocio aplicadas\n- Viewport estricto 1029×466px sin scroll global\n- Escala notas 1.0-7.0, aprobación en 4.0\n- Gatekeeper: criterio excluyente < 4.0 → nota = 1.0\n- Ponderaciones estructurales deben sumar exactamente 1.0\n- Evaluación COMPLETADA es inmutable\n- Borradores en Redis con TTL 30 días\n- Paleta corporativa EvalUA aplicada","tree":{"sha":"ed008e0079f95a609818b1438ec6184e1b1a2a5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/ed008e0079f95a609818b1438ec6184e1b1a2a5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/6f3c1fd3218f5fd34d1fe6ff3353928b39d7c739","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/6f3c1fd3218f5fd34d1fe6ff3353928b39d7c739","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKDZmM2MxZmQzMjE4ZjVmZDM0ZDFmZTZmZjMzNTM5MjhiMzlkN2M3Mzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/d11a741def531581fc761b7196d8365c7b3385fd","sha":"d11a741def531581fc761b7196d8365c7b3385fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/d11a741def531581fc761b7196d8365c7b3385fd"}],"sha":"6f3c1fd3218f5fd34d1fe6ff3353928b39d7c739","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/6f3c1fd3218f5fd34d1fe6ff3353928b39d7c739"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/commits/d11a741def531581fc761b7196d8365c7b3385fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T07:42:18Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T07:42:18Z","email":"loco.cansado@gmail.com","name":"alphadx"},"message":"Entorno de desarrollo LLM completo para EvalUA v3.0. Se han creado 25 archivos de configuración organizados en 7 categorías:\n\n## Archivos Creados\n\n### `.cline/rules/` — 4 Reglas Globales (siempre activas)\n- `architecture.md` — Stack, DDD documental, Iframe-Driven, Zero-Knowledge, Docker\n- `coding-standards.md` — TypeScript estricto, naming conventions, Zod, RFC 7807, testing\n- `security.md` — JWT HS256, RBAC, CSP headers, logs sanitizados, tenant filtering\n- `domain.md` — Ponderaciones = 1.0, Gatekeeper, FSM estados, inmutabilidad, caché L2\n\n### `.cline/skills/` — 5 Skills Especializadas (activables bajo demanda)\n- `ddd-scaffolding.md` — Genera estructura de 4 capas para nuevas entidades\n- `gherkin-test-generator.md` — Transforma archivos `.feature` en tests Vitest\n- `api-route-generator.md` — Genera endpoints protegidos con JWT + Zod + RBAC\n- `iframe-component-generator.md` — Genera componentes optimizados para 1029×466px\n- `docker-compose-generator.md` — Genera config Docker con healthchecks y volumes\n\n### `.cline/hooks/` — 2 Git Hooks\n- `pre-commit-lint.md` — TypeScript check + ESLint + Prettier + secretlint (bloquea commit)\n- `post-commit-test.md` — Ejecuta tests de dominio post-commit (informativo)\n\n### `.cline/agents/` — 3 Agentes Especializados\n- `domain-architect.md` — Revisor de diseño DDD documental, guardián de pureza de dominio\n- `security-guardian.md` — Auditor de seguridad JWT/XSS/CSP/RBAC/Zero-Knowledge\n- `test-engineer.md` — Generador de tests BDD/TDD con cobertura ≥ 80%\n\n### `.cursor/rules/` — Compatibilidad Cursor IDE\n- `evalua.mdc` — Reglas globales comprimidas para Cursor\n\n### `.github/prompts/` — Compatibilidad GitHub Copilot\n- `crear-entidad-ddd.prompt.md` — Prompt para scaffolding DDD\n- `crear-vista-iframe.prompt.md` — Prompt para vistas iframe\n\n### Configuración del Proyecto\n- `.vscode/settings.json` — Formateo, ESLint, rulers, file associations\n- `.vscode/extensions.json` — 12 extensiones recomendadas\n- `.mcp.json` — Conexión Docker MCP Gateway (SSE, puerto 8089)\n- `.env.example` — Variables de entorno requeridas\n- `.gitignore` — Exclusiones estándar Node.js/Next.js/Docker\n\n### Documentación\n- `documentacion/13-entorno-desarrollo-llm.md` — Guía completa del entorno LLM\n- `documentacion/00-indice.md` — Índice actualizado con nuevo documento\n\n## Para comenzar a desarrollar\n```bash\ndocker mcp gateway run --transport sse --port 8089\ndocker compose up -d\n```","tree":{"sha":"9571e876919295c7fc7be12ea50bafc9f285d52d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/trees/9571e876919295c7fc7be12ea50bafc9f285d52d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alphadx/evalUA/git/commits/d11a741def531581fc761b7196d8365c7b3385fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5598428?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx","id":5598428,"login":"alphadx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTg0Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alphadx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/d11a741def531581fc761b7196d8365c7b3385fd","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ItxtoAKGQxMWE3NDFkZWY1MzE1ODFmYzc2MWI3MTk2ZDgzNjVjN2IzMzg1ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alphadx/evalUA/commit/bcd0a34c724e5c24065416963036e6859a16980b","sha":"bcd0a34c724e5c24065416963036e6859a16980b","url":"https://api.github.com/r