2026-10-08T23:24:37.585Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274993448?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pearadet-lk","id":274993448,"login":"pearadet-lk","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQRKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pearadet-lk/smart-logistics-platform/commits/1e9860de897798d19c2fd839c26b41351c99bbbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T03:44:53Z","email":"pearadet.lk@gmail.com","name":"Pearadet Luckkam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T03:44:53Z","email":"pearadet.lk@gmail.com","name":"Pearadet Luckkam"},"message":"Add Docker compose, Dockerfiles, and services\n\nIntroduce a full-stack Docker configuration and numerous microservice projects for local development. Adds root compose.yaml to run the entire platform (infrastructure, .NET APIs, gateway, and Angular web), legacy docker-compose overlays, service Dockerfiles (AI, reporting, tracking, web, gateway updates), and a .dockerignore. Registers new API projects (Ai, Reporting, Tracking, plus service implementations, EF migrations, and outbox/event consumers) and shared library additions (audit, auth, features, workflow, extensions). Updates solution and README with usage, endpoints and portfolio features to enable one-command local stack startup and improved developer onboarding.","tree":{"sha":"baec4f1eaf80a9137e03c6aa2eb000be5bd55f29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pearadet-lk/smart-logistics-platform/git/trees/baec4f1eaf80a9137e03c6aa2eb000be5bd55f29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pearadet-lk/smart-logistics-platform/git/commits/1e9860de897798d19c2fd839c26b41351c99bbbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274993448?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pearadet-lk","id":274993448,"login":"pearadet-lk","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQRKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pearadet-lk/smart-logistics-platform/commit/1e9860de897798d19c2fd839c26b41351c99bbbf","node_id":"C_kwDOS4QZmNoAKDFlOTg2MGRlODk3Nzk4ZDE5YzJmZDgzOWMyNmI0MTM1MWM5OWJiYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pearadet-lk/smart-logistics-platform/commit/2b15009433539d66d21c8b854a10b6e29c132c96","sha":"2b15009433539d66d21c8b854a10b6e29c132c96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pearadet-lk/smart-logistics-platform/commits/2b15009433539d66d21c8b854a10b6e29c132c96"}],"sha":"1e9860de897798d19c2fd839c26b41351c99bbbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pearadet-lk/smart-logistics-platform/commits/1e9860de897798d19c2fd839c26b41351c99bbbf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274993448?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pearadet-lk","id":274993448,"login":"pearadet-lk","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQRKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pearadet-lk/smart-logistics-platform/commits/2b15009433539d66d21c8b854a10b6e29c132c96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T06:30:36Z","email":"pearadet.lk@gmail.com","name":"Pearadet Luckkam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T06:30:36Z","email":"pearadet.lk@gmail.com","name":"Pearadet Luckkam"},"message":"Add Docker & Minikube deployment tooling\n\nIntroduce local dev ops tooling to run the full stack locally via Docker or Minikube. Adds Dockerfiles for billing, notification and tariff services and updates the gateway/shipment Dockerfiles to expose ASPNETCORE_URLS. Adds docker-compose.local to run all .NET services with the existing infrastructure compose file and tweaks kafka/network settings. Adds PowerShell and shell scripts for docker deploy/teardown and full Minikube deploy/teardown; Minikube scripts build images into the Minikube daemon, apply k8s manifests and start automatic port-forwards (PIDs saved to .minikube). Adds a new infrastructure/k8s/minikube/ kustomization including namespace, secrets, configmaps, deployments and services for postgres, keycloak, gateway and APIs (imagePullPolicy: Never for local images). Adds appsettings files for Docker/Kubernetes for gateway and services, scaffolds an Angular frontend under web/smartlogistics-web, updates README with detailed Docker/Minikube/frontend usage, and adds .minikube to .gitignore.","tree":{"sha":"deb7b0190d2102e9c5c881718c0fdfa6cac4a375","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pearadet-lk/smart-logistics-platform/git/trees/deb7b0190d2102e9c5c881718c0fdfa6cac4a375"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pearadet-lk/smart-logistics-platform/git/commits/2b15009433539d66d21c8b854a10b6e29c132c96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274993448?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pearadet-lk","id":274993448,"login":"pearadet-lk","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQRKA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pearadet-lk","user_view_type":"public"},"html