tps://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/AI-Ready-Engineer-LMS/commits/e829c7c91c25569d326b7bd64dd1e2584dfdb564/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T11:39:28Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T11:39:28Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Restructure to 3-workspace monorepo, move storage to MongoDB GridFS, UI polish\n\nStructure:\n- Reduce monorepo to LMS_Backend / LMS_Frontend / LMS_Admin only.\n- Remove LMS_Database, LMS_Documentation, LMS_Deployment.\n- Inline LMS_Shared into each app at src/shared (backend via #shared subpath,\n  apps via @/shared); merge LMS_AI_Engine into LMS_Backend/src/ai-engine\n  (@anthropic-ai/sdk now a direct backend dep).\n\nStorage:\n- Store all uploads in MongoDB GridFS (services/fileStore.js); serve via\n  GET /api/uploads/:filename with HTTP Range support. Remove on-disk LMS_Storage.\n- One-off migration script for legacy disk files.\n\nFeatures/hardening (previously uncommitted):\n- In-app notifications + audit log, automated tests + CI.\n- GDPR self-export + admin erase, CSV exports, structured logging + optional Sentry,\n  proctor-snapshot retention.\n\nUI polish:\n- Shared Skeleton/EmptyState/ErrorState primitives adopted across both apps;\n  NotificationsBell + focus/press states; motion-token cleanups; scrollable sidebar;\n  header avatar + clickable profile link.\n- Add backend jsconfig (#shared resolution).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"777ea4caabddc8a655bf85c822daa6178f662a4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/AI-Ready-Engineer-LMS/git/trees/777ea4caabddc8a655bf85c822daa6178f662a4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/AI-Ready-Engineer-LMS/git/commits/e829c7c91c25569d326b7bd64dd1e2584dfdb564","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/AI-Ready-Engineer-LMS/commit/e829c7c91c25569d326b7bd64dd1e2584dfdb564","node_id":"C_kwDOS4ceINoAKGU4MjljN2M5MWMyNTU2OWQzMjZiN2JkNjRkZDFlMjU4NGRmZGI1NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/AI-Ready-Engineer-LMS/commit/799d1f97c2db32444ad8c933721c6ed52465d574","sha":"799d1f97c2db32444ad8c933721c6ed52465d574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/AI-Ready-Engineer-LMS/commits/799d1f97c2db32444ad8c933721c6ed52465d574"}],"sha":"e829c7c91c25569d326b7bd64dd1e2584dfdb564","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/AI-Ready-Engineer-LMS/commits/e829c7c91c25569d326b7bd64dd1e2584dfdb564"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_